{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 43190,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next wave of AI is here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46470,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Evolving beyond thinking to acting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49530,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's bigger than anyone imagined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51790,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Except AMD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54130,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We recognize this agentic era would\nrequire the highest performing GPUs and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58630,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "CPUs working together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60670,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're the only ones who build both."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63310,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's how agentic AI moves from answers to\naction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66550,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pushing inference compute to tremendous\nscale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69990,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like an agent that frees thousands of\nemployees from smaller tasks to focus on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74990,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bigger things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77210,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A car that safely handles a new city like\na local on its first day there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84490,
    "dDurationMs": 6220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And an agent that pinpoints a disease in\nmillions of cells, then designs a cure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93130,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've built more AI computing power into a\nsingle data center than existed on Earth a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98650,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "decade ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100470,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now, we're giving you the tools."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105030,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So together, we advance AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127000,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good morning!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129940,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a pretty good good morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132460,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good morning!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133820,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good morning!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135940,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And welcome to Advancing AI 2026."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139200,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's so great to be back here in San\nFrancisco and to see so many friends and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143540,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "partners and customers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145340,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And especially all the developers that are\nhere with us today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149340,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I want to say a big welcome to\neveryone who's joining us online from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152900,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154620,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is my absolute favorite event of the\nyear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158180,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's where we bring the entire AI\necosystem together to show what we've been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162860,
    "dDurationMs": 420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "building."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163280,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And where we're going next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165240,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this year, this is our biggest show\never."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167720,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because we have so much to tell you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170440,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's go ahead and get started."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173720,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At AMD, our mission is to push the\nboundaries of high performance in AI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178060,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "computing to help solve the world's most\nimportant challenges."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182100,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I often say, AI is the most important\ntechnology of the last 50 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188040,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And frankly, the progress that we're\nseeing in the industry is just incredible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192180,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, every month, every few months,\nwe see something new that was far beyond"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197180,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our imagination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198820,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can already see the impact across\nevery industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203000,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In healthcare, AI is helping researchers\nidentify new drug candidates faster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208000,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In science, we're solving problems that we\ndidn't think were possible a few years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212480,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213520,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And across every industry, AI is changing\nthe way we get work done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218360,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the most important thing is we're\nstill in the very, very early innings of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224300,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what's possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226300,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, just take a look at some of these\ncharts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228460,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, we look at these every year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230100,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you kind of see the rate and pace of\nAI growth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234800,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A couple of years ago, we were just\nstarting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237060,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People were experimenting with chatbots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239320,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, it was really cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240640,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you look at today, we're really\nseeing more than 35 quadrillion tokens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246500,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "consumed every single month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249360,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's an increase of nearly 160 times in\njust two years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254200,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that curve is actually just getting\nsteeper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257140,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're going to hear a lot about that\ntoday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259840,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, just looking at, you know,\nwhere is all that demand?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262780,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, obviously, training remains\nincredibly important and foundational."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266320,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And over the last four or five years,\nyou know, we see the compute that's used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270400,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for training advanced models continuing to\nincrease by, let's call it, roughly 5x"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275460,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276720,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those models are getting better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278260,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, we're all experiencing that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279620,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're seeing better reasoning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280800,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're seeing new capabilities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282540,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're now seeing a growing number of\nspecialized models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285880,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one of the things that I really\nbelieve in is there is no one perfect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290120,
    "dDurationMs": 380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290500,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we're all going to use a slew of\ndifferent models, depending on what task"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294960,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're trying to solve and which industry\nyou're in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298800,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the bigger shift is actually in\ninference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302240,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we expected this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303480,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We expected that inference would grow\nfaster than training."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307040,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we can say that in 2026, for the first\ntime, the world is using more AI compute"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312540,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to run models than to train them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315200,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we've seen that to a point where we\nthink this year, roughly 60% of the global"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321480,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AI compute capacity will be used for\ninference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325000,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the reason for that is actually pretty\nsimple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329000,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As billions of people every day use AI,\nthe workload shifts from building models"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334240,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to putting them to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336020,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually, we're going to talk a lot\ntoday about agentic AI, and that's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340780,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accelerating the shift even faster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342380,
    "dDurationMs": 6660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you think about all of this,\nwe see agents as the next big step for AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349760,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the most interesting thing is this has\nreally just started accelerating over the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354780,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "last, I would say, five or six months this\nyear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357960,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when we started with LLMs, they were\ngreat to answer questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361800,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we found that to really get the power\nof AI, you want agents to be able to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367840,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really answer full questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370100,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you give it a goal, it keeps working\nuntil it's solved the problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375420,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what that means for us in the compute\nindustry, it means that compute demand is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381740,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "growing at an incredible pace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383860,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're actually seeing a step change in\ncompute demand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387840,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because when you ask the agent to do\nsomething, it actually has dozens of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392620,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "steps."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393260,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it has to reason, and it has to call\ntools, and it has to access data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397100,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it has to keep doing it over and over\nuntil it's solved the problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400980,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so you need lots of GPUs to do all\nthat reasoning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404600,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But importantly, you also need a lot of\nCPUs to orchestrate every step around it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410960,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you look at just what that means\nfrom a market standpoint, it's really hard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415820,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to put this market data up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417800,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I feel like every few months,\nwe're changing the perspective based on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421900,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what our customers are saying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423880,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what we're seeing is that the shift to\nagentic AI is certainly growing the AI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429780,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accelerator market very significantly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433120,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was actually last year at this event\nthat we called the AI accelerator market"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437580,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at about 500 billion by 2028."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441060,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at that time, it actually felt like a\nvery big number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446440,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Didn't you think it was a big number?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449060,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But honestly, you look at it today,\nand it looks conservative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451800,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the AI demand is just continuing\nto accelerate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456460,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see it, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457420,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Better models, more usage, more usage\nrequires more compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461620,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And more compute actually builds better\nmodels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464780,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we're now expecting that by 2030,\nthe AI accelerator market is going to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469760,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reach about 1.4 trillion by 2030."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473820,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what do you think about that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474820,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that a big number?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480380,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, what that means is by the end of\nthe decade, the AI accelerator market is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485660,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to approach the size of the entire\nsemiconductor market today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490600,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And although there will be many different\ntypes of accelerators, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493900,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm a big believer in there's no one size\nfits all as it comes to chips."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498360,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We do expect that GPUs are going to make\nup the vast majority of that market"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503080,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the algorithms are still very much\nin their infancy, and we're still"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507820,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "continuing to see the workloads change,\nand that favors programmability in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513680,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "overall silicon ecosystem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517020,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, perhaps the most interesting part of\nthe last six months has been, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522100,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GPUs are only part of this story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525160,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we're actually seeing is agentic AI\nis creating an entirely new growth vector"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530160,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
