    "tStartMs": 834820,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're continuing to see every major\ncustomer move more workloads to EPYC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841720,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on the GPU side, our Instinct adoption\nhas also accelerated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846080,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have a broad set of customers across\nthe largest AI labs, cloud providers,"
