  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868060,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what we're seeing with Frontier AI is\nit's really raising the bar for what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873740,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "infrastructure needs to do."
