    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "data center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895780,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just as importantly, this is about\nmaking these systems super easy to use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901280,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so they need to be easy to deploy,\neasy to service, and very reliable."
