  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953780,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958840,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is Instinct, EPYC, and then the\nPensando chips for networking that are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965400,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inside each rack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966620,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And every one of these chips is part of\nthe system."
