    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's kind of take a look at how these\nthings fit into the overall system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998360,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So first, this is now the MI455\naccelerator, which is mounted on what we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004840,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "call an Enhanced Accelerator Module,\nor EAM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009100,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a production module that goes into\nHelios, and it is much more than the GPU"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014080,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "package."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015280,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The EAM actually integrates the GPU,\nmemory, power delivery, high-speed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021420,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interfaces, system management,\ncold plates for liquid cooling,"
