  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031080,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pretty cool, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037640,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if I just give you some of the specs,\nwe're talking about 320 billion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042380,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "transistors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043480,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is built with TSMC's leading\n2-nanometer and 3-nanometer process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1048240,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049500,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And most importantly, it brings together\nnearly a decade of AMD chiplet innovation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054340,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it allows us to combine 12 compute and\nI/O."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058060,
    "dDurationMs": 6820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chiplets with 432 gigabytes of memory,\nall connected by leading industry 3D chip"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064880,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stack packaging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066260,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I can say for sure, it's the highest\nperformance AI accelerator in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070880,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078360,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so this is the CPU board that's\ninside the Helios compute tray."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082340,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm going to talk a lot about CPUs\nlater."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084860,
    "dDurationMs": 6580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But just to give you a high-level view,\nit's high-speed, 96-core EPYC processor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091700,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "DDR5 memory, all the I/O"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1093640,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's needed to feed the GPUs,\nall in a single motherboard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097660,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we also have our Salina DPU."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100980,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a critical part of the networking\ninfrastructure, and it really allows us to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106420,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "deliver both front-end as well as the\nscale-out and scale-across bandwidth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111540,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "overall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113080,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is our Vulcano AI NIC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115720,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see this actually allows us to\nreally have up to six Vulcano NICs on a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122040,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "board."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122540,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it uses the open ultra Ethernet\nstandard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1125540,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So each Helios compute tray includes two\nof these Vulcano boards, and that allows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130280,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "us to have the scale-out and the scale-up\nnetworking overall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136200,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you put all that inside the rack,\nand we have an additional six dedicated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141500,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "networking trays that handle the scale-up\nnetworking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144580,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those are all connecting 75 GPUs\ntogether with UA-Link over Ethernet with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150040,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "silicon from our partners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151860,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what we mean by an open\necosystem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155000,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you bring this all together,\nI want to say Helios is simply the best AI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1160680,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rack in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170110,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, let's take a look at some numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172110,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Clearly, it's a very competitive world out\nthere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174890,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you compare Helios to the\ncompetition, we're delivering 15% more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1180010,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "compute, 50% more HBM4 memory capacity and\nmemory bandwidth, and 50% more scale-out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187130,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bandwidth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188250,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what that means is that every Helios\ncan deliver more performance for the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193550,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "largest models, more capacity for longer\ncontext, and the bandwidth to scale across"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1199330,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thousands of racks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201770,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now we can kind of come over here and\ntake a look at another very large piece of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206170,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207210,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is now the production hardware that\ncustomers are deploying, and you can see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1211090,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more of that as you go through the exhibit\ncenter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215850,
    "dDurationMs": 6220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And each one of these weighs more than 160\npounds and stands less than two inches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222070,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223010,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's just an extraordinary amount of\ntechnology when you look at what's in one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227750,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of these trays."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1229070,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when you bring these things together,\nthe numbers are just incredible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1233270,
    "dDurationMs": 8400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More than 18,000 CDNA5 GPU compute units,\nover 4,600 Zen6 CPU cores, and 31"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241670,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "terabytes of HBM4 memory, all in a single\nrack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246310,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what it takes to run agentic AI at\nscale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1251590,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So today I'm excited to announce that\nHelios is in full production."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264000,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have shipments on track to start at the\nend of the third quarter and ramping into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269040,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the fourth quarter in the second half of\nthe year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1271540,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I can tell you customer demand for\nHelios is extremely strong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1275920,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we're extremely proud of the work that\nwe have done across the leading AI labs to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1280860,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "adopt Helios."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282240,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so let's start with some of our\nguests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1284600,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today I'm excited to be joined by our\nnewest Instinct partner and one of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1289160,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leaders in Frontier AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290900,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To share more about what we're doing\ntogether, please welcome Anthropic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294220,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "co-founder and chief compute officer Tom\nBrown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308050,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, Tom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1309070,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is so great to have you here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310810,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is really such an honor to be\nworking with Anthropic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1314610,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We had a big week this week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316590,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We did, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317730,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So look, Anthropic has just had incredible\nsuccess over the last few years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1323310,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, Claude has made such a big\nimpact on the overall industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327070,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Compute is such an important factor in the\nprogress."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1330410,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you just talk a little bit about your\ncompute strategy and just how things have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1334710,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "been evolving?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335970,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah.\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336450,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And first, thank you so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337850,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A hard act to follow with Helios."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339390,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340590,
    "dDurationMs": 8460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with Anthropic, as you mentioned,\nthe scale that we're growing just as an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349050,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "industry is enormous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1351610,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we have been working to make sure\nthat we have the best, like different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357970,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chips, and we can use the best chips for\nthe best workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362810,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363410,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And look, I think you've been really\nleading in that area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1366550,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, I'm happy to say that I've\nalways wanted to be as part of your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371950,
    "dDurationMs": 420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372370,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I remember the early times we talked as\nyou were starting Anthropic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375530,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we had a big announcement this week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377270,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're honored that you will be deploying\nup to 2 gigawatts of Helios."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1381290,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382390,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was the key reason?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384630,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385970,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think that the first thing was just\nHelios is an amazing machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391890,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's absolutely fantastic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1393710,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do we like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394790,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does that work for us?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399110,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I think the thing that we were\nthinking about originally was whenever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403210,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're bringing up a new hardware platform,\nit's a big effort."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407030,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a huge thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408450,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so as part of the..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1411250,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as we were thinking about this,\nwe started doing our own evaluation of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415630,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MI355."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1417350,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You guys generously got us a rack to start\nworking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420350,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we expected this to be kind of a big\nprocess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423210,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our actual experience was we had one\nengineer start doing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429010,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They spun up... they connected it to\nClaude, asked him, hey, bring up this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1433910,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "machine, left it going over the weekend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436370,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we ended up with a graph of the actual\nperformance of our leading model on it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1441730,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just going up and up and up over the\nweekend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445050,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1448710,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that that's a testament to the\nopen platform that you guys have made"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452330,
    "dDurationMs": 7340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where anyone like human or AI can now\nbuild real models on your platform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460470,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tom, I kid you not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461650,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When my team told me that you had an\nengineer working on MI355, I said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1466550,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hey, are we making sure we help them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469270,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they're like, they say they don't need\nany help."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471510,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They got it all covered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1472770,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, hey, that's a wonderful\nstory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475950,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477050,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we're also super excited about the\nwork we're doing together because one of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481210,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most valuable parts of this\npartnership is Claude and using Claude"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485330,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "within AMD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486310,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're big believers in the fact that AI is\nthis force multiplier and the more we're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491810,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "able to have the leading foundational\nmodels really familiar with the AMD"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496110,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "architecture, the better we're going to be\nable to service the overall market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499750,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can you just talk a little bit about\nhow you're seeing Claude really evolve in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504210,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these types of highly engineering-specific\nworkloads?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1507530,
    "dDurationMs": 6540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, so I think this is a great place for\ncollaboration where the bread and butter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1514070,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Claude is doing software engineering."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1516330,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now more and more we're seeing it help\nout with the type of workloads that you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1519850,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "guys are doing also, like design,\nlayout, which is not quite the normal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1525110,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "software engineering, but is adjacent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1527470,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I do think that that is the place\nwhere we can work together to make the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532750,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "next generation of chips even better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534810,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I think, and also on the software\nside, I think the work that we've seen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1539470,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with Claude and the kernel development has\nbeen just incredible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1544470,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, Tom, one of the things for our\naudience here, we like to talk about the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1548570,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "present, but it's actually most of us are\nworking on the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1552090,
    "dDurationMs": 6340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is really the beginning of what we\nbelieve is a very strong multi-year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1558430,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "partnership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1559670,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you talk a little bit about,\nnumber one, what are you most excited"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562970,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about in the industry?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563970,
    "dDurationMs": 6780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then number two, like, what can we do\nmore together to really make sure that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1570750,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're satisfying those key opportunities?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573950,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's a great question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1575890,
    "dDurationMs": 7860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think the working together for the\nscale-up seems like it's probably the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1583750,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "biggest thing that I'm most excited for,\nwhere it does seem like we see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1587450,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "consistently using more better compute\nresults in better models that then add"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594690,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more value to all the folks using it\ndownstream."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1597050,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think that's the biggest thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598750,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I think one thing now that we're\ninvesting more and more with you guys,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1603010,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "too, and I think we can continue to,\nis security, where that's a place where"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1608110,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now, as the machines are getting more\ncomplex, we can work together to secure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1613090,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things at the chip layer, the server\nlevel, the rack, the whole network,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617470,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that'll help out, like, not just us,\nbut the entire industry stay safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1621730,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, I think you're completely right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1623450,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are super focused on the idea of,\nyou know, how can we use AI to improve"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1627930,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every aspect of our product, whether it's\nperformance, power, software, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1633250,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "security, as you said."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1634770,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So really, Tom, huge thank you for the\nopportunity to work very closely with you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1641490,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and your team."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1641970,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our team loves working with you guys,\nand we look forward to everything that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1645570,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're going to do together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1646650,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1647590,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655130,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright, so look, Tom talked about how\nimportant performance is, and we have been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1661210,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "laser focused on ensuring that the\nreal-world performance of MI455 and Helios"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1666930,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really comes true when we look at,\nyou know, system results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671570,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's take a look at some of those\nresults."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1675090,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here's an example."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1676590,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're running DeepSeek V4 Flash,\none of the latest reasoning models,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1680410,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we are actually comparing MI455 to\nMI355."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1684150,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, the key thing is with every\ngeneration, we want to make huge leaps in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1689770,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690490,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're seeing that at lower concurrency\nthat MI455 delivers 4x the throughput of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1696570,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MI355."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698150,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But clearly what you see with,\nyou know, large users across the board,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703950,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you want to increase the number of\nsimultaneous users, you want to increase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1707370,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the amount of work that you can do at the\nsame time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709730,
    "dDurationMs": 6300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so at the highest concurrency,\nwe're seeing Helios deliver up to 34x more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1716030,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "throughput than our prior generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1718630,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what that means is more users,\nmuch faster response, and much better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1723590,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "efficiency at scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726450,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And performance is just one aspect of it,\nright?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728950,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other aspect and, you know,\nwhat I should have mentioned when Tom was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1731790,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on stage is every one of us in the\nenterprise is seeing our AI budgets go up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1736450,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every single month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1737730,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738590,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you seeing some of that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740370,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so customers really care about cost\nper token."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744790,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with every generation of Instinct,\nwe're driving the cost per token down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749350,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's with more memory, more\nbandwidth, and much more compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753670,
    "dDurationMs": 6900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we're taking another major step with\nMI455, delivering up to 18x more tokens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1760570,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "per dollar, so customers can serve far\nmore users with the same investment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1765250,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as you think about how that comes\ntogether in a rack, many of our data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1771770,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "centers right now are really limited by\npower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1774050,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So power is kind of the maximum limiter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1776830,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we tested Helios over a full range\nof workloads where you have a fixed rack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1782350,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "power compared to the competition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1784790,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what we're seeing is across the\nhighest throughput workloads, the most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1788510,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interactive applications, all of these\nleading inference workloads, we're seeing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1792890,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Helios an average of 10-15% more\nperformance than the competition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798370,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that comes with all of the system work\nthat we've done in the overall system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1804270,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how that translates to a customer is\ncost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1808230,
    "dDurationMs": 6380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we expect is the Helios rack delivers\nmore performance, and it also delivers up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1814610,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 30% more tokens per dollar than the\ncompetition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1818330,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think that's a pretty good overall\nvalue proposition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1829360,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I'm happy to say that the customer\ndemand for Helios is extremely strong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1835000,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From the largest AI labs to hyperscale and\nNeoCloud providers, we are working across"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1840480,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the entire ecosystem to enable Helios\ntogether with our OEM and ODM partners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1846920,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one of our deepest and earliest\npartners deploying Helios is OpenAI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1851740,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To talk about where AI is headed and the\nwork we're doing together, please welcome"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1856780,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the stage OpenAI's Head of\nInfrastructure, Sachin Katti."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1866920,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, thank you, thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1868820,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Sachin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869820,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's so great to have you here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1871800,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And most importantly, we are so thankful\nfor the partnership with OpenAI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1876160,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've been through so much on this journey\ntogether."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1879020,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you're really operating on the frontier\nof AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1882760,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you just tell us a little bit of what\nyou're seeing and just what compute looks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1887540,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like for you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1888840,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks, great to be here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1890360,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was thinking about this event over the\nlast two years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894380,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like the attendance at this event\nis following scaling laws."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1899240,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been doubling every year over the\nlast two years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1902800,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But more seriously, to your question,\nwe've always predicted that models will"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908940,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evolve where they will start as chatbots,\nthen they become reasoners, then they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1913660,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "become agents, then they become interns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1916360,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the trajectory has kept up with that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918980,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we are all seeing that models are\nbecoming a lot more capable, more agentic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923540,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and able to do very long-running tasks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1926680,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let them go and they just take care of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1929080,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so all that really means is we need to\nkeep scaling compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1933760,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The more compute we scale and throw at\ntraining, the more capabilities emerge,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1939220,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more compute we scale and provide it\nto distributing intelligence to the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1944220,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more people want to do with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1946440,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is what we see with exploding\ntoken budgets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1950400,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've seen internally, for example,\nin OpenAI, that not just engineering,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1954080,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but every aspect of the enterprise is\nbeginning to use agents for every part of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1959200,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1959880,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why we need platforms like yours\nthat can scale with how quickly the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1965800,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "capabilities of these models are scaling,\nas well as how quickly the whole world is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1970180,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "beginning to embrace what these things can\ndo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1972320,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, Sachin, I don't think I've ever\nspoken to you where you haven't asked me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1977140,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for more compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978340,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he's actually very, very consistent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1981380,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look, our teams have been working really\nclosely together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1984600,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's been a true journey when we\nthink about just all of the technology"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1988540,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we've been doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1990340,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Last year, we announced a really landmark\npartnership where you're going to deploy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1996360,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up to six gigawatts of AMD infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1999440,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're one of the first, I think you're\nthe first to actually have MI455 racks a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2004820,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "few months ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2005640,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can you talk a little bit about the\njourney?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2008220,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, it's been a phenomenal partnership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2010820,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you mentioned, we were first to bet on\nAMD, and we are really thrilled with how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2016580,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that bet is turning out for us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2018540,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It got started on MI300 and expanded very\nquickly to 355."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2023860,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's been really fun for our team to\nsee how it was possible to optimize the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2030740,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "software stack, the networking and\neverything, and deploy our models running"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2035600,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on AMD infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2037600,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, as Lisa mentioned, we just got hands\non the Helios racks three months ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2042580,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the collaboration has gone to the next\nlevel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2045520,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our engineers are working side by side\nwith AMD engineers to optimize the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2050700,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "software stack and run GPT class workloads\non Helios already."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2055340,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Phil will probably be on stage later\ntalking about how productive and fast that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2062060,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "collaboration is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2063140,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we are really excited about the\ncapabilities Helios is already showing us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2068080,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we expect that we'll be deploying\nHelios at massive scale starting towards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2072820,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the end of this year and then accelerating\nthroughout 2027."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2076480,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I said, I know, more faster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2078980,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need it earlier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2082080,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, Sachin, the other thing is,\none of the most exciting parts of our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2085920,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "collaboration is actually some of the\nresearch work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2088200,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So very thankful for the opportunity to\nspend really bringing our best engineers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2093900,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "together with your researchers to talk\nabout how AI should be really implemented"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2099660,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and used for future both silicon and\nsoftware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2104020,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can you talk a little bit about that\nwork?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2106340,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I think one of our key bets,\nand I think for a lot of us in AI,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2112460,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is about recursion, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2114360,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AI recursively improving the systems it\nneeds to run on and eventually,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2120340,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "obviously, AI doing the research itself,\nright?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2123200,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, expert engineers spend an enormous\namount of time optimizing kernels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2128480,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "figuring out how to translate new models\nto run them efficiently on different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2132340,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hardware, dealing with all the usual\nthings you think about, compilers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2136080,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "communications, libraries, system\nconfigurations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2138800,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we've been super excited and\nencouraged by the work we are doing with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2144740,
    "dDurationMs": 6780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you is now AI showing the potential and\ndemonstrating it in production to automate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2151520,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a significant portion of the work when\nanyone programs to an AMD GPU."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2156080,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it dramatically has shortened the path\nfrom a new model coming up to an efficient"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2162280,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "production deployment and something that\nwe can much more easily tune to changing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2167420,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "workload requirements, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2169000,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's a big deal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2170760,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one of the other things that's super\nexciting for us is because AMD is built"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2174980,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around an open software ecosystem,\nall these things that we are now inventing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2180620,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "internally for our own use, we believe\ncan, we can also bring it to the whole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2184920,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "world and allow the whole world to use it\nfor all of the AI models out there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2189980,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not just our models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2191720,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think super excited about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2193260,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the idea is that it's really the\ntide that lifts all boats, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2197300,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As we work, it helps our work together,\nbut it really helps the overall ecosystem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2201760,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a little bit of your crystal ball."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2204380,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Looking forward, I think we all know that\ncompute is super critical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2208920,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you need from the next generation\nAI infrastructure?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2211960,
    "dDurationMs": 6340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what can we do as really a key partner\nto help you accomplish that mission?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2218800,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you haven't heard already, I need more\ncompute more quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2223560,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At least he's consistent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2228520,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the thing that the whole industry\nis realizing is it's a systems problem at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2234340,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a data center scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2235840,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think we obviously very quickly\ninternalized that AI was a rack level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2240000,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "problem, but now it is very clear that\nit's not just a rack level problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2244160,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's a rack in a data center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2245960,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the whole data center is a system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2248080,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we have to think about how we design\nthe future based on what we know about our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2252880,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "workloads, what's coming down the line,\nbut co-design it with you from CPUs to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2258100,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GPUs to memory, networking, storage,\npower distribution in a data center,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2262720,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the cooling systems that go with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2264780,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are all intertwined and they all\nhave to be co-designed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2268800,
    "dDurationMs": 6940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one of the really fun parts about what\nwe do with you and your team is how easy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2275740,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and productive it is for us to work with\nyou and give you insight into how we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2280820,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "expect the world to change in the future\nfrom what our workload needs are,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2284500,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what our models are, and how quickly your\nteam responds in turning those insights"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2289740,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into better chips, better systems,\nbetter software."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2293100,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's what worked really well with\nMI400 and left shifted a lot of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2298820,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engineering work that we needed to do to\nbring this up online quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2302740,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's why we are very confident we\ncan productionize those systems very"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2307060,
    "dDurationMs": 420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2307480,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so really looking forward to\naccelerating that with MI500 and beyond"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2312080,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and increasingly using AI to actually do\nthat work for us rather than being limited"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2318100,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2319860,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's fantastic, Sachin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2321320,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And look, we really do recognize that\ninput is so, so valuable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2325360,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I have to say thank you again for just\nthe extraordinary partnership,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2329800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the amount of work that our joint teams\nare doing together, and we couldn't be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2333400,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more excited about the opportunities in\nfront of us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2336280,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Sachin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2337220,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2338120,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2343990,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2345090,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now let's turn to the world of CPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2348990,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's been a lot of talk about CPUs\nrecently, and I can say that this has been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2353010,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the foundation of our AMD data center\nstrategy for the longest time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2357670,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We launched EPYC in 2017, and we've been\non a very, very clear mission."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2363230,
    "dDurationMs": 6220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every generation, more performance,\nmore efficiency, more capability for a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2369450,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wider range of workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2371450,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, Naples was our first generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2373410,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It established the foundation,\nbut Rome and Milan really changed the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2377410,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "economics in the data center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2378770,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We did more than what people expected in\nterms of adding core count and adding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2383690,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "throughput."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2384910,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then Turin set... Genoa expanded our\nperformance, and then Turin set a new bar"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2390190,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for density, throughput, and total cost of\nownership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2393630,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's really been the EPYC formula."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2395550,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A clear roadmap and very consistent\nexecution, and leadership that actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2401670,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "grows with every generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2404330,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why, if you look today,\n5th Gen EPYC Turin is the best server CPU"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2408930,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2410290,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With up to 192 cores and 384 threads,\nTurin delivers leadership performance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2416690,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across a broad range of cloud,\nenterprise, and HPC workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2421810,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the thing about the data center is\ncompute never stands still."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2426950,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With agentic AI, it's actually creating a\nwhole new class of infrastructure,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2430990,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the CPU matters now more than ever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2434790,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's exactly what we built Venice\nfor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2438630,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, there's been a lot of talk about\nagentic AI, but it's actually a very new"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2442430,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "field."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2443310,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what we see is that server computing\nis actually splitting across a couple of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2449190,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "different workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2449890,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, the first section is GPU servers,\nand that's fairly well known."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2456090,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's where the CPU's job is basically to\ndrive the GPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2461230,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, the job there is all about speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2465030,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We want the highest frequency cores,\nwe want the fastest IO, and we want to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2469230,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "keep the GPUs fully fed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2471850,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the biggest middle part, this is the\nlargest growth, is actually in agent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2475650,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "servers, or what we call agent sandboxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2478790,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is actually a whole new class of\nworkload."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2482010,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here, you execute code, you actually call\na bunch of tools, you actually query data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2487290,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's outside the model, you have a whole\nbunch of things around it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2491650,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in this place, the priority is\nactually density."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2495390,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, we want the highest performing cores\nper watt to run thousands of agents at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2501550,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2502770,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we have our traditional general\npurpose servers that run the enterprise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2507090,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here, you're going to have a diversity\nof workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2510150,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's all about efficiency, it's running\nthe applications, it's running databases,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2513990,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's running data services."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2515730,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And all of that is what we traditionally\nsay is general purpose server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2521830,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, with these different workloads,\nyou actually need the right CPU for the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2526590,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right workload."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2527890,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And EPYC is the only CPU portfolio that\nleads across all three."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2533690,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, Venice is our newest and most advanced\nserver CPU family, and it's actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2539290,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "designed for the agentic era."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2542150,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're extending Turin's leadership across\nevery single metric."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2545890,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is performance, that's efficiency,\nthat's TCO for cloud, that's enterprise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2551430,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "efficiency, that's HPC workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2554430,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Venice starts with our all new Zen 6\ncore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2558290,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have higher IPC, higher frequency,\nand that delivers up to 1.8 times more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2564930,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance than Turin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2566730,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is one of the largest generational\ngains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2569850,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, we have been doing this for six\ngenerations, but this is one of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2573550,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "largest generational gains in the history\nof EPYC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2576970,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's 203 billion transistors built on\nTSMC's newest two nanometer process,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2582650,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it uses a next generation chiplet that\nsupports up to 512 threads per socket."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2588330,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is actually a really important\npoint."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2590390,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to show you why in a few\nminutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2593370,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This gives us the highest compute density,\nbut it also allows us to double both the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2598250,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "memory and the IO bandwidth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2600290,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I have a few more chips to show you,\nif that's all right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2605290,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what's clear is Venice is not one\nchip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2610430,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Venice is actually an entire family of\nchips."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2613910,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is where our chiplet architecture\nbecomes a huge, huge advantage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2618310,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It lets us take the Zen 6 architecture and\nbuild a whole portfolio around it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2624830,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's start with this guy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2628150,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is Venice HF."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2631230,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the highest performing CPU that\ndrives AI host nodes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2637630,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has eight compute chiplets,\neach with 12 cores, running at up to 5"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2642950,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gigahertz with the IO and memory bandwidth\nto keep the GPUs completely fed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2647270,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is the CPU that I showed you\nbefore shipping inside Helios."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2660890,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, this is its bigger brother."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2664210,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's Venice 256 core."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2666930,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the chip that's built for agentic\nsandboxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2670790,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it also has eight compute chiplets,\nbut each of the chiplets now has 32 cores."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2675970,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it scales all the way to 512 threads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2679350,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is the highest compute density in\nthe industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2689060,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Customers get more agent capacity per\nwatt, per dollar, per rack, bar none."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2698270,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, and then one more member of the\nfamily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2701490,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one is Venice 128 core."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2704650,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this guy is optimized for enterprise\nand general purpose servers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2708510,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the same leadership performance\nper core, but it's in a lower cost,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2712970,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lower power design for enterprise\napplications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2716630,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this one is really tuned to give\ncustomers the best performance per dollar"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2720410,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across a wide range of configurations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2723010,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can see really the power of the\nfamily as they come together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2728370,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in addition with these guys,\nI can tell you that next year we're adding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2732170,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a few other chips to the family."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2734130,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're adding Verano, which is the next\ngeneration for AI host nodes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2738170,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what that adds is a more power\nefficient, low power memory, as well as"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2743330,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "faster interconnect between the CPU and\nthe GPU."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2746750,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we're also adding for our high\nperformance computing, our technical"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2750150,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "computing, Venice X, which is using our 3D\nvCache stacking technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2755510,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we're really the first to stack memory\nchiplets right below the compute chiplets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2760310,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to accelerate performance, even for those\ntypes of workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2764330,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can see one architecture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2766430,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A CPU is not a CPU."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2769570,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are many different types of CPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2771950,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for us, one architecture spans dozens\nof different chips."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2776130,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that breadth is someone that no other\nCPU vendor can match."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2780450,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what makes 6th Gen EPYC the\nbest CPU in the data center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2791980,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you're going to bear with me because\nI'm going to take you through some"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2794660,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance because the numbers are just\nincredible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2798000,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So looking at AI workloads, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2800160,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, you have different use cases and\ndifferent workloads, starting first with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2805320,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GPU servers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2807020,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many of the largest frontier models\nrequire you to move data between the CPU"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2811660,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the GPU."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2812800,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in that scenario, Venice moves the\ndata faster than the best competitive x86"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2817840,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "processor, delivering up to 1.8 times more\ntokens per second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2823680,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when you look at the agentic CPU\nservers and sandboxes, because of our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2827620,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "density, Venice delivers more than twice\nthe agents per watt for agent sandboxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2833280,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for general purpose applications,\nin this case, we're standardizing on a 100"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2837580,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kilowatt rack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2838880,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Venice delivers more than twice the\nperformance per watt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2842360,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So pretty incredible results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2846480,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the gap is even wider if you look at\nARM processors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2851240,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you look at the leading ARM\nprocessors, when we're comparing at the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2855440,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chip level, Venice supports up to 2.8\ntimes more agents per watt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2860860,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when you look at the rack level,\nVenice is delivering up to 3.3 times more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2866000,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance per watt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2867800,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what that means is at the data center\nscale, you can just get a lot more agents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2873680,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the same power envelope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2883300,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, there's been a lot of talk about what\nmatters most for agentic AI, with some"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2888900,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "saying that per-core performance under\nload is the only thing that counts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2893340,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's really only part of the story,\nbecause agentic AI actually runs as a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2899020,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "distributed platform, and that is across\ndatabases and vector stores and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2903700,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "orchestration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2904900,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And all of that has to happen at once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2907480,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that requires not just raw speed,\nbut you absolutely need density,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2913980,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "efficiency, and per-core performance all\ntogether."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2917060,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what I'm happy to say is that Venice\nleads across every one of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2923220,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you compare Venice against the\nhighest performing ARM CPU from our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2927500,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "competition, EPYC delivers 20% higher\nper-core performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2933900,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when we..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2939690,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like that number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2941790,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like that number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2943270,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when we pair that with leadership core\ndensity, we're delivering 2.2 times more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2947990,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance at the socket level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2949450,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so the main point is, whether a\ncustomer needs per-core or per-socket"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2955330,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance, Venice is the leader."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2958390,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's one more point that a\nbenchmark doesn't really capture,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2962630,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because when you think about what agentic\nAI is, it's really like you're adding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2966650,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thousands of employees to your enterprise,\nto your traditional workflow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2971770,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that software, enterprises have been\nrunning on for years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2975790,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The truth is, that software runs on x86."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2980610,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Venice runs all of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2982310,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is where x86 has an advantage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2984730,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You must have the best performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2986370,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You must have the best density."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2987970,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But having that software compatibility is\na big, big plus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2991890,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So customers scale up their agents on the\nstack that they already have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2996870,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now, let me just show you what that\nmeans at the rack level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3000230,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So at the rack level, what we find is\ndensity is super important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3004050,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everyone's trying to optimize their data\ncenter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3006310,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everyone's trying to optimize their power\nenvelope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3009070,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with Venice, every major server OEM is\noffering a broad spectrum of racks for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3014770,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "agentic AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3016090,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what that means is we have the full\nspectrum from 25,000 cores to 50,000"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3022370,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cores."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3023190,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's more agents per rack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3025250,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that gives customers the choice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3027950,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The key is, every data center is\ndifferent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3030250,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with that, the flexibility allows you\nto pick the right cooling, the right space"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3036070,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "requirements for what you're trying to do\nin your data center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3039750,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there you have it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3041550,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Venice, the best server CPU in the\nindustry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3051620,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm very happy to say also today that\nVenice is in full production."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3056200,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Customer demand is incredible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3058300,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the strongest we've ever seen for a\nnew EPYC generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3066990,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're seeing every major server OEM,\nevery major cloud provider on track to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3072110,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "begin rolling out in the fourth quarter as\nwe start with making the broadest EPYC"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3077290,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "launch we've ever had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3079450,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with that, I want to turn to my next\nguest, who runs some of the largest and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3084430,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most advanced compute infrastructure in\nthe world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3086810,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's really been our privilege to\npartner with them as they've deployed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3090530,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "multiple generations of both EPYC and\nInstinct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3094070,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To share more about our work together,\nplease welcome to the stage Meta's Head"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3098030,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Infrastructure, Santosh Janardhan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3110750,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is so great to have you here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3112470,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you for being here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3114550,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Santosh is a true friend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3116830,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have to say it's been a tremendous\nopportunity over the last few years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3121470,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My story about Santosh is the first time\nI sat in his office."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3125410,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He said to me, Lisa, we're going to deploy\na lot of CPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3130350,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Please make sure they work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3132910,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I said, I will, I will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3135010,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you lift it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3137070,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I try."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3138410,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I try."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3138990,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But look, Santosh, Meta operates,\nyou operate some of the most advanced"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3143590,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "infrastructure in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3146110,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's happening in the data center world?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3147810,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's happening in your world?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3148810,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tell us a little bit about the\narchitecture and what you're working on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3153810,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure.\nFirst of all, thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3154870,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's awesome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3155590,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is like a hardware geek's paradise,\nright?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3158170,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You come in, you're talking about\ntransistors, you're talking about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3161250,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hardware, talking about cooling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3162790,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is sort of the gem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3163690,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3165250,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think there's an audience that's\nreceptive to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3168250,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I usually talk to audiences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3170170,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have usually either not been to a\ndata center or not really seen a chip"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3173570,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3174450,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is refreshing, I have to say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3177470,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thing I'll say about..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3178810,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Listen, we are seeing demand go through\nthe roof."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3182590,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you look at inference, training,\nrecommendation system, that's how a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3186270,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "newsfeed works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3188010,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Content creation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3189390,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The demand for that is just exponential\nright now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3192650,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when I think about sort of the\noverall..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3197170,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark has this vision of delivering\npersonal super intelligence to billions of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3201690,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3202430,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you go to sort of Facebook or\nInstagram or WhatsApp or whatever surface"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3206350,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you go to, the idea is that we'll meet you\nthere and we'll deliver super personalized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3211250,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "intelligence right wherever you are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3214170,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's why we established this Meta\ncompute initiative and because it's a top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3218410,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "level thing, Mark himself oversees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3219750,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now what it means is that we are now\nmoving away from an area where we used to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3225230,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "take servers, optimize it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3227030,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is what the conversation we were\nhaving many years ago, that, hey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3229950,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm deploying a CPU, I really need to\nmaximize performance out of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3233650,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's different now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3234990,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You talked about how we should be thinking\nabout the whole system end to end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3239270,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are at a point where we have to look\nabout the whole data center and think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3243690,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about it as one integrated system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3245890,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Servers, hardware, networking,\ncooling, power, all of that is not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3250290,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "optional."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3250830,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of that has to work together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3252670,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is where I think there's a huge\nopportunity for collaboration with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3255990,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "partners like AMD because you have to now\nco-design, co-create systems, not just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3261910,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "deploy something that comes off the shelf."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3265130,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other thing is, by the way,\nflexibility."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3267450,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thing I really like about what you\nsaid is that this is such a big"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3271690,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "opportunity in the industry right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3274110,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of us need to lean in and work on this\ntogether."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3277450,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it needs to be open."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3279930,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It needs to be heterogeneous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3281950,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think that's not one company,\none partner that works for any one of us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3287030,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need to sort of work on this together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3289030,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's why I think you're one of our\nmost important strategic partners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3293030,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Santosh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3293770,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And look, we completely agree with your\nphilosophy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3297490,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, you are actually one of our broadest\npartners because if you think about our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3301330,
    "dDurationMs": 6340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "work on CPUs, GPUs, you know, we developed\nthe Rackscale OCP systems together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3308370,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've deployed lots and lots of CPUs,\nso millions of CPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3312310,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you're a lead partner on Venice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3314950,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you just talk a little bit about sort\nof your CPU and infrastructure and some of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3317990,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our work together?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3319430,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3320130,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been many years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3321390,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the story that Lisa was saying was\nmany years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3323970,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we went from Milan to Bergamo to\nTurin, now to Venice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3328870,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's at least the fourth generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3330950,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a long-time partnership, obviously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3334270,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I actually think the world is changing in\nthe sense that it used..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3338790,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The world is changing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3339350,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every year is a new world these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3340990,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like every month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3342510,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Months, exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3343370,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what ends up happening now is that it's\nnot just a GPU game anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3346970,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's CPUs and GPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3348430,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If anything, I think CPUs are becoming at\nleast as important, if not more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3352570,
    "dDurationMs": 6540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're looking at a world where sort of\nthe workload is changing because while you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3359110,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have your workhorses and GPUs,\nat the end of the day, there's agentic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3363730,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3364270,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to run your tools."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3365410,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to run your systems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3366550,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And all the code that's been generated\nstill needs to run somewhere, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3370810,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm super excited to work on Venice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3372990,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think there's a lot to come there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3375870,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you have to think again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3378790,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a theme that I'm assuming will go\nthroughout the presentation that you have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3382590,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to start thinking about CPUs and GPUs as\nconjoined things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3386050,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You hand off workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3387210,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Depending on the workload, you employ the\nright hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3390150,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, absolutely right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3391850,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we've gotten a lot of feedback from\nyour technical team."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3394590,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that's what I really appreciate\nabout the partnership with Meta."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3399490,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, clearly, you're deploying lots of\nGPUs too, a lot of accelerators."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3403770,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you're also one of our deepest\npartners on the accelerator side,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3407930,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting with MI300."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3409290,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we had a very large strategic\npartnership announced around up to 6"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3415150,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gigawatts, starting with MI450."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3417590,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what we're doing is quite unique with\nMeta."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3419530,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can you talk a little bit about the\nevolution and the MI450 plans?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3426210,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, multi-year collaboration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3428390,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we started with MI300."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3430570,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We did a bunch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3431430,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It had really nice memory capacity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3433030,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I remember talking to you about that,\nright?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3435110,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then there's a bunch of pipelining we\ndid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3437590,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was important to just have deployed\nthat at production scale, sort of get"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3442210,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hands-on experience on both sides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3444490,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "350 is the first time we deployed this on\nour ranking and recommendation systems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3448310,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's now getting into sort of some\ngood numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3452550,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And 450 is, I think, I'm super excited\nabout it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3454850,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We just got some of the racks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3456710,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we are going to deploy it across the\nboard because it gives us the opportunity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3460910,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to go and sort of really collaborate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3463790,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the big difference between the\n300, 350, and 450 is that we have had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3468690,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engineers sitting in the same room talking\nto each other, co-designing, co-creating,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3473430,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like power cooling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3475370,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I was saying, it's not just a single\nthing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3477790,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we are not shy in feedback."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3480490,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're not shy, for sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3482990,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you're very receptive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3484230,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is true partnership, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3486130,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the point about co-designing and\nco-creating that, I think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3490150,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And like I was saying, that's a huge sort\nof deployment coming in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3494410,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The more we deploy, the earlier we\nco-design, the better we are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3498630,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, absolutely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3499550,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really, really appreciate the effort\ntogether on MI450."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3503450,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I want to ask you also about your\ncrystal ball."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3506250,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you look out into the future and you\nsee what the next few years really means"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3511130,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as you push forward in the AI industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3514590,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are the biggest challenges and really\nopportunities for us?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3518010,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the industry ecosystem here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3519830,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what should we be focused on as an\nindustry?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3522710,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Listen, all of you know about the\nbottlenecks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3525110,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know about the power, the data\ncenters, the silicon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3528870,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of these, I think, are choke points\nthat I think the industry is waiting on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3533490,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But those are things I'm pretty confident\nwe'll sort of work our way through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3537250,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the end of the day, I think the demand\nis immense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3540070,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People are responding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3541770,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the thing that I really want to make\nsure all of us realize is that we should"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3546290,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not think about systems in isolation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3549510,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I was saying, CPUs and GPUs are one\nconjoined system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3552270,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We should start thinking about it that\nway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3553730,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We really need to co-design things early."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3558750,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, data centers take years to build."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3561350,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of my favorite stories is Mark comes\nto me and says, hey, I want a gigawatt worth of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3565610,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "data centers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3566350,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, you should have talked to me two\nyears ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3568510,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It takes time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3569830,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the same with silicon, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3571350,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just takes time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3572950,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we need to be starting and sitting down\nin a room co-designing today for what we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3578170,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "need to deploy in 27 and 28."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3580550,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That, I think, is when we truly unlock all\nsort of powers of the system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3584550,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The systems are amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3585570,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The specs are amazing, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3587130,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But think about how much more you can get\nout of it if you sit in a room and just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3591790,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "co-design it today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3592910,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in 28, we'll be having much better\ngraphs out there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3597410,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fantastic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3598090,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Santosh, I completely agree with you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3599850,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to say again, thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3601730,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are so, so happy with the amazing\npartnership that we have across the board"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3606270,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, most importantly, with your\nengineering teams."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3608870,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we truly are excited about what we're\ngoing to do in the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3611750,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3619000,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you heard Santosh talk about just the\ndiversity of workloads and really the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3624600,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "massive scale that you require with AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3627420,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I want to turn to another part of the\ninference market where the requirements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3631200,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are actually very different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3633140,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So lots and lots of workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3635420,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as inference is moving into more\nproducts and services, we're actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3639000,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seeing it segment into different workloads\ndepending on what you're trying to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3643360,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of these are, let's call it,\nless interactive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3645620,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they're really tuned for, let's call\nit, maximum throughput or the lowest cost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3650900,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Other of these applications require more\nbalanced throughput, so you have to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3654240,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "balance throughput and responsiveness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3657360,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then there's this new class of\napplications that actually want very,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3661640,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very fast results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3662660,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have extremely smart engineers and\nthey don't like to wait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3666280,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is where ultra-low latency or\nevery millisecond actually matters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3671720,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each one of these types of workloads\nrequires a different type of compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3676380,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one of the best ways to reach\nultra-low latency today is disaggregated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3681200,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3682220,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you think about the different\npieces, both prefill and decode are two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3687740,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "different jobs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3688720,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So prefill tends to need more compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3691560,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Decode tends to need more memory\nbandwidth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3694100,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with Instinct, we have a very balanced\nmachine so that we deliver both great"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3698560,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "compute and great memory bandwidth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3700840,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you can actually take this a step\nfurther."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3702860,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you know what workloads you're trying\nto run, you can actually let customers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3706920,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tune each of these pieces independently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3709940,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to address this market opportunity,\nwe've been working with Cerebras."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3714700,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to talk more about what we're building\ntogether, please welcome to the stage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3718280,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cerebras co-founder and CEO Andrew\nFeldman."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3730330,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Andrew, it's great to have you here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3731950,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been an exciting few months for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3734470,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know that for those who don't know\nexactly what you've been working on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3738590,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can you talk a little bit about Cerebras\nand what problem you've been trying to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3741990,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "solve?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3743050,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3743830,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Great to be here and great to be sort of\namong people who love hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3748810,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, it's nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3750650,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look, I'm thrilled to be here with you and\nto announce our cool new partnership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3757870,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At Cerebras, we build the world's largest\nand fastest chip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3762330,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a full wafer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3763810,
    "dDurationMs": 8640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we package this into a system into\nracks and then racks into clusters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3773510,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we deliver them both on-premise and\nvia the cloud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3777690,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you've had some of our customers up\nhere already today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3781250,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the Frontier Labs, we serve customers\nlike OpenAI and in the hyperscalers like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3786850,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AWS, in the small agentic and the coding\nspace, leaders like Cognition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3793750,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they do this because we're\nblisteringly fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3799790,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no question, Andrew, that you have\nsome tremendous innovation with what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3804590,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you've been working on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3805650,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And our teams have been collaborating\nreally closely over the last few years to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3810110,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really have Helios together with the wafer\nscale engine for ultra low latency"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3814170,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3815150,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you just kind of just educate the\naudience a little bit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3817630,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are we trying to do and what does\nthat mean for customers?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3819990,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, I think what's happened,\nand you described it previously,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3824530,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that sort of AI has moved from being a\nnovelty to being useful and then in some"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3830010,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "domains a necessity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3832190,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when something is a necessity,\npeople want to use it and they want to use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3837110,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3837910,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to serve this market, this segment of\nultra low latency, we sought a partnership"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3843730,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that could extend our capabilities and our\nfootprint."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3849050,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there was no better answer than AMD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3851510,
    "dDurationMs": 6420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We were already an AMD customer as we use\nAMD CPUs to surround our systems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3858110,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we were so excited at the opportunity\nto build a disaggregated solution that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3863270,
    "dDurationMs": 9380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "combined AMD CPUs, the cool new Helios\nrack and the cerebrus wafer scale engine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3873190,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, look, the technology is pretty cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3876270,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So just talk a little bit about how it\ncomes together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3878670,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3880050,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as Lisa described, what you have with\nInstinct and the Helios rack is that you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3885230,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have the leader in performance and memory\ncapacity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3890130,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you marry that with our wafer scale\nengine, which is the leader in sort of in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3895970,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "SRAM and in memory bandwidth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3898490,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that combination allows us to deliver\na solution that is unmatched in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3903510,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3904950,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very, very exciting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3906050,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know that customers are excited about\nwhat we're going to do together as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3909330,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when are we going to have it in market?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3912950,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Later this year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3914290,
    "dDurationMs": 9380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will be first in the cerebrus cloud and\nit will be later at a store near you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3925230,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the key thing is we're going to\ngive customers a choice to really put"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3929830,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "together what is the solution that they\nwant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3932850,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think we're very, very happy to be\nable to do this together with you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3935690,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think it's a huge step up in terms of\nwhat we can do for this ultra low latency"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3940130,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "segment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3940830,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3941650,
    "dDurationMs": 6980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think until recently, customers sort of,\nthey could have sort of high throughput or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3948630,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they could have extraordinary speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3950650,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by bringing together the Helios rack\nwith the cerebrus wafer scale engine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3956730,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we give you five times the throughput\nwhile continuing to deliver this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3962470,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "extraordinary speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3963790,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really something amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3967810,
    "dDurationMs": 200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fantastic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3968010,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, look, Andrew, huge congratulations\nto what you and the Cerebras team have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3972190,
    "dDurationMs": 440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3972630,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I think it's been incredible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3973850,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think you've been clear on what you're\ntrying to accomplish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3977430,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's really nice to see not only it\ncome together, but us come together to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3982010,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "offer a solution that will be very,\nvery compelling to customers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3985330,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we can't wait to get this into\ncustomers' hands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3987790,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3988750,
    "dDurationMs": 440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3989190,
    "dDurationMs": 440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good to see you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3989630,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3990470,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Andrew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3996240,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3997180,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So look, I think we've shown you a lot of\nhardware this morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4001300,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as we all know, hardware is only part\nof the story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4004260,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's actually software that turns all of\nthis into a platform that developers can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4008600,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really build on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4009820,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to share the progress we're making with\nROCm, please welcome AMD Senior Vice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4014120,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "President of AI, Vamsi Boppana,\nto the stage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4023870,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Lisa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4024810,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good morning, everyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4026350,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4027410,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's great to be back to talk about\nsoftware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4029750,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just a few years ago, programming AMD GPUs\nrequired deep expertise and significant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4035810,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engineering effort."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4037150,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've come a long, long way in a\nremarkably short period of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4041370,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Through our open source community\ncollaboration and sustained investment in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4046630,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ROCm, our software stack, AMD Instinct\nGPUs are powering some of the most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4051290,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "important and consequential workloads on\nthe planet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4055330,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the biggest change is still ahead of\nus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4058530,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AI is transforming how software is getting\nbuilt, and we are bringing that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4064090,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "transformation to ROCm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4066590,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what I'm excited to share with\nyou guys today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4069690,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our software teams have been moving fast\nwith relentless focus on developers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4074330,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've invested at every level of the stack\nin build and test infrastructure so we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4079570,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ship faster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4081270,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ROCm releases now go out every six\nweeks, not every four months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4086010,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've continued to expand the work we do\nwith our AI ecosystem partners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4091170,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the result?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4092650,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More features, faster performance,\nand a significantly better out-of-the-box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4097470,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4099290,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our strategy that has gotten us here has\nbeen remarkably consistent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4104350,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's built on two core principles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4107370,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Partner deeply with the open source\necosystem and build with the right layers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4112350,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of abstraction to enable developer\nproductivity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4115050,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Open source gives us velocity and scale,\nand abstraction makes developers more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4121570,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "productive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4124210,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our deep, deep commitment to open source\nhas resonated with the community that has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4129050,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "truly embraced AMD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4131210,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From frameworks and compiler stacks to\ninference engines and model hubs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4135070,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AMD is now becoming part of default\nenablement for the most important AI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4140090,
    "dDurationMs": 6860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "communities, such as Hugging Face,\nPyTorch, JAX, vLLM, and SGLang."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4147510,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why new models get Day Zero\nsupport and why the world's most important"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4151990,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AI workloads run on AMD today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4154950,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a big shift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4157930,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inspired by engineers seeking\nproductivity, abstractions have evolved to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4162670,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enable work at the right level of detail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4164610,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hiding complexity when they want speed,\nand exposing control when they need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4170410,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4171830,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From low-level programming in assembly and\nC to block programming abstractions like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4176210,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Triton to Pythonic frameworks,\nwe've invested in key abstractions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4181790,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Aiter, our kernel library, and Atom,\nour serving engine, get you peak"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4187150,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance without writing the kernels\nyourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4191230,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "FlyDSL is a brand new Pythonic\ndomain-specific language that gives you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4195750,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "low-level control with the performance of\nhand-tuned C++."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4200370,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Mori, our communications library,\nhelps deliver leadership performance on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4205970,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the latest models, like Minimax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4209790,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But look, something very, very exciting is\nhappening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4213430,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over the past year, I've seen something\nremarkable inside AMD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4216590,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our engineers are using AI models to\ngenerate GPU kernels, optimize code,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4223070,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "debug issues, and improve performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4225050,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in some cases, these AI-generated\nkernels are shockingly good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4229930,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Better than what we expected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4231910,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes better than the most\nmanually-tuned versions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4236130,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first time you see this, you're a\nlittle bit skeptical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4239430,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You run more tests, you try to break it,\nyou look for what went wrong, and then you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4244110,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "realize this is real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4246330,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What has happened in general software\ndevelopment is coming to significantly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4252450,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "transform GPU programming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4254110,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's going to reduce the time it takes to\nbring up workloads, make optimization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4258830,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "automated, and it will remove any\nremaining barriers to broad adoption."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4264630,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We want to put that capability in the\nhands of every developer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4269850,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So today, I am excited to introduce ROCm.ai."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4282210,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's an agentic AI platform that brings\nthe capabilities of AI-assisted GPU"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4287370,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "programming to developers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4289150,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It starts with the simple idea of giving\ndevelopers access to the power of an AMD"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4293830,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ecosystem through the AI coding agents\nthey already use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4297690,
    "dDurationMs": 6340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether you're using Cursor, Claude,\nCodex, rocm.ai helps those agents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4304030,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "understand AMD platforms, understand\nROCm, and helps you build and optimize"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4309130,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4310850,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other words, we are making those\npopular coding agents into ROCm super"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4316350,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "users."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4317170,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You should be able to describe the\nworkload you want to run, the performance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4320530,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "target you want to hit, and then let the\nagents help you get there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4324910,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For years, we have been building the open\nsoftware foundation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4329030,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we are adding an AI-assisted layer\nthat helps developers use that foundation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4334550,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "faster and more effectively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4336790,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me show you what is inside ROCm.ai."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4340330,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's built on the foundational\ncapabilities of ROCm, our core software"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4344590,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stack, runtime, libraries, compilers,\ntools, framework integration, all of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4350730,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "core software that makes the stack work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4352450,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On top of that, we built a layer of\nAI-assisted optimization called Hyperloom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4360130,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Using Hyperloom, the system can analyze\nthe workload, tune configurations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4365330,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "select and tune kernels, adjust\nparallelism strategies, and iterate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4369330,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "towards performance goals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4371610,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To give you an example of the power of\nHyperloom, I was talking to the lead"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4376010,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "developer last week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4377250,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He told me they just pushed through a\nsuite of 14,000 models through Hyperloom,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4383210,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "optimizing them and creating valuable\ninsights."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4386590,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This would have been impossible to\nimagine, even with a large team of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4391330,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engineers before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4392570,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the power of Hyperloom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4394890,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally, we provide an AI-native\ninterface for our developers, AI skills"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4399990,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that allow coding agents to understand\nROCm natively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4403010,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm incredibly excited by what we have\nbuilt with rocm.ai."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4407490,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's going to profoundly transform the way\ndevelopers interact with our platforms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4412630,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me make this concrete for you with\nan example."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4415890,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine you are a developer who wants to\noptimize Minimax M3 with vLLM on MI355s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4422410,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, there are many things you need to\nget right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4425570,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need the right vLLM optimizations,\nthe right model recipes, the right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4429710,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "environment variables."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4430870,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You may need to write new kernels or\noptimize kernels, and then you still need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4434870,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to tune all of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4437250,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With rocm.ai, this interaction becomes\nmuch simpler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4442610,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's see it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4443470,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can say, optimize Minimax M3 with\nHyperloom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4448390,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Enter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4450590,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And behind the scenes, the agent does what\nan expert would do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4455770,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pulls a known good recipe, runs and\nprofiles the workload."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4458830,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It creates and tests a bunch of kernel and\nruntime configurations, and it keeps"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4462950,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "iterating towards target."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4465970,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can actually watch on screen here\nrocm.ai write a GPU kernel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4471130,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sees an opportunity to write a more\noptimized MOE group gem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4475890,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the result?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4477390,
    "dDurationMs": 6460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rocm.ai delivers a 38% more tokens per\nsecond improvement on this specific"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4483850,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "example."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4485110,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the experience we want for\ndevelopers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4487630,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Simple to start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4492240,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's pretty cool, huh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4497640,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Simple, simple to start and powerful to\noptimize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4500740,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've continued our relentless focus and\nperformance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4503920,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With every release, we've delivered\nsignificant performance gains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4507920,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On leading models like DeepSeek,\nrocm.ai delivers 3.3 times speed up over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4513540,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ROCm 7."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4514940,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This has been made possible by innovations\nat every level of the stack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4518260,
    "dDurationMs": 6500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Techniques such as the use of block-scaled\nfused MOE kernels, KV cache quantization,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4525320,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "export parallelism."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4526920,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But look, the bigger story is how AI\nagents actually profiled the workload,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4531480,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "proposed new kernels, tested\nconfigurations, and actually validated all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4535340,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4537360,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That exact same focus is also on\ndelivering performance gains for training."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4542700,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the same hardware, rocm.ai improves\ntraining performance by an average of 2.4"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4547780,
    "dDurationMs": 460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4548240,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Through optimized kernels such as fused\nflash attention, more efficient"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4553040,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "checkpointing, and advanced parallelism\nstrategies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4557320,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our engineers have done amazing work to\nunlock the capabilities of MI455 through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4562360,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rocm.ai."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4564060,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm delighted to share some incredible\nresults on hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4568040,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On running real workloads, we are able to\nsee the system deliver 20 terabytes of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4573720,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "memory bandwidth and 20 petaflops of\ndelivered compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4577660,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the highest demonstrated compute\nplus memory capabilities of any"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4583760,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accelerator platform in the industry\ntoday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4587100,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not theoretical, there's measured."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4595380,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Super exciting that we were able to share\nthis on day one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4598640,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm also thrilled to share that the\nleading AI ecosystem partners who have had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4602720,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their hands on MI455 have had a delightful\nexperience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4606420,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see here what they've had to say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4609740,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From end-to-end PyTorch testing,\nto ensuring Hugging Face models are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4613700,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "getting validated, to vLLM and SGLang\nrunning well on MI455."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4618680,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are incredibly encouraged and excited\nby what the community is about to unlock"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4623400,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with MI455."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4625280,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This matters because day zero readiness is\none of the most important objectives we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4629700,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "strive for, and that's what rocm.ai\nenables."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4633680,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now let's look at rocm.ai in action\non Helios."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4638160,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This time we are going to use a Codex\nfront end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4641300,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's deploy DeepSeek V4 Pro, a 1.6\ntrillion parameter frontier model on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4647340,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Helios."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4648460,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now watch what happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4651400,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rocm.ai pulls the right recipes,\nit configures the runtime, it implements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4657220,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the model graph onto hardware,\nand finally serves up the model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4663190,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There you go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4664900,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The model is actually up and running."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4667320,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And let's see the model write a simple\npoem now about advancing AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4672780,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's hit enter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4675400,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't that a pretty cool poem?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4682070,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the experience we want to give our\nusers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4684930,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The developers should not have to manually\nreason through every layer of model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4689210,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "architecture, kernel selection,\nCOM strategy, and rack level deployment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4693550,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AI is transforming this experience,\nand that is a very, very big shift for GPU"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4699490,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hardware and software."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4702330,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, there are few organizations shaping\nthe frontier of AI as much as OpenAI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4707450,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You heard Lisa and Sachin talk about our\npartnership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4710790,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been truly wonderful collaborating\nclosely with the OpenAI technical team to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4715670,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make rapid progress with ROCm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4717710,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To talk about how they are advancing the\nfrontier of software development and our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4722510,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "collaboration, I'm delighted to welcome to\nstage Philippe Tillet from OpenAI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4736040,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you for joining us here,\nPhilippe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4738760,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So just so you all know, Philippe is the\ncreator of Triton, one of the most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4743180,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "important software innovations in modern\nAI infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4746280,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a huge privilege having you here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4748160,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4752640,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OpenAI has always pushed the limits of\ninfrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4756680,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can you tell the team a little bit here\ntoday as to how your team actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4760660,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "develops GPU software and how have\ntechnologies like Triton evolved?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4765080,
    "dDurationMs": 440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4765520,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, first of all, thanks so much for\nhaving me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4767920,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was here two years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4769080,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's my great pleasure to be back now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4772360,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A way of looking at things is there's no\none way to fit all applications,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4777400,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we really try to meet users where they\nare."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4780020,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for that reason, we've developed\nmultiple solutions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4783920,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for workflows where speed of iterations\nis more important, we've developed Triton,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4789440,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as you mentioned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4790240,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is typically what researchers will\nuse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4793340,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But more and more, we've been in a case\nwhere we've had to hyper-optimize"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4796980,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance, and Triton didn't give us the\nlevel of control that we wanted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4800980,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we've developed Glion for that,\nwhich is a lower-level language."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4805560,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this way, we've been really able to\noptimize our kernels for AMD, among other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4810280,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4813500,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our agents have become extremely good at\nboth of them, and we've worked with AMD on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4818480,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both of them as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4821800,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More and more, what we're seeing is agents\nslowly taking over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4827880,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're getting just very good,\nas you just mentioned, at writing this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4830820,
    "dDurationMs": 460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4831280,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4832740,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So look, I think the work you have done\nwith Triton and now Glion, it's been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4836300,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really, really moving the ball forward for\nthe entire industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4840020,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we began our work together with 300\nand extended at 350, but now we're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4844760,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "collaborating at a different scale with\n450 and Helios."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4848240,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I would love to hear your thoughts on\nhow that collaboration has been going,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4851900,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how has that experience been?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4853980,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, super well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4854940,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like ages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4856800,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we started years ago on hardware\nco-design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4860360,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, when MI450 was in the very early\nprototyping stages, I think we were able"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4866440,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to work really well together, and it's so\nnice to see the outcome of that and the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4870740,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4872500,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And more recently, we've been working\nvery, very deeply on software enablement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4877240,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for MI450, both for our models,\nbut also for the broader ecosystem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4881740,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a lot of this development has been done\nopen source."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4885420,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yeah, we're collaborating on the full\nstack now, down to the very low-level LLVM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4891160,
    "dDurationMs": 7100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "code generation, so that all the nice\nhardware advances that came with MI450 can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4898260,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be properly leveraged in end-to-end\napplications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4902020,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, and you got your Helios racks,\nso tell us a little bit about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4906720,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, it worked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4908480,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We got the chip,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4916650,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and very quickly, a single engineer in a\nfew days was able to confirm that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4922170,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything worked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4923250,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Obviously, we have to optimize performance\nmore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4926290,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we're very confident we can get in a\nvery, very good place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4929930,
    "dDurationMs": 440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Awesome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4930370,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's awesome to hear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4931790,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So look, one of the more amazing things\nthat we've done recently is our teams have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4936270,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "collaborated even more closely in terms of\nusing AI to program AMD GPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4942570,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we'd love to hear your thoughts and\nanything you can share with the audience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4945850,
    "dDurationMs": 7940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, no, I mean, everyone in this room\nknows how much agents are taking over our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4953790,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jobs, in a sense, as kernel engineers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4958570,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's been amazing just to see how much\nbetter they've got over just the past six"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4964710,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4965450,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just now, they're extremely good at\ngenerating high-quality GPU kernels in a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4969930,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "way that were not before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4971630,
    "dDurationMs": 6940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's been very great collaborating\nwith AMD on just making sure that agents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4978570,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not only are capable enough, but also have\nall the right context they need to be able"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4984530,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make good decisions and good\noptimizations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4987410,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's great to hear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4988330,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the quality of code that's getting\nproduced by AI-assisted kernel generation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4994370,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has been truly remarkable through our\ncollaboration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4997470,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very excited."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4998010,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, as you look ahead, what crystal ball\ndo you have for us for the future of AI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5004650,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "software ecosystem and collaborations like\nours?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5008170,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, so there's two things that really\ncome to mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5011370,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One, as we keep talking, is just how good\nagents are getting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5016830,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the other one is, I think,\nhow much the open approach to software of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5021250,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AMD is enabling, not only for OpenAI,\nbut I think for the industry as a whole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5026250,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I talked a little bit earlier how we've\nbeen collaborating on LLVM co-generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5031230,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LLVM is an open source project."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5033510,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The entire compiler stack from AMD is open\nsource."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5036970,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that has allowed us to make our agents\nreally good at very, very low-level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5041130,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "co-generation, down to scheduling\ninstructions in assembly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5045550,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this has led to very, very significant\nperformance gain that I don't think we'd"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5051590,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have been able to achieve in a fully\nclosed source stack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5055150,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's one of the real sort of big\nvalue propositions that we have to offer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5061090,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because everything that we do is in the\nopen, and the fact that AI can actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5065590,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right?\npick that up is a big one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5067030,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Philippe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5067890,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We truly appreciate the partnership,\nand we're really excited about what we're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5071350,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to build together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5072270,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, my pleasure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5072970,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much for having me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5079390,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What you just heard is extremely\nimportant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5082390,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we combine better abstractions with\nAI-assisted development and closed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5087430,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hardware software co-design, we can create\nsome incredibly powerful capabilities,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5091810,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's exactly aligned with our\nstrategy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5095390,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, everything I have shown you so far\nhas been about AI, but ROCm is also a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5100790,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "great stack for developing\nhigh-performance and scientific computing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5103750,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "applications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5104870,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From frontier models to climate\nsimulation, we use the same ROCm,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5109210,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same library, same tools, same\nAI-assisted development, one open stack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5113790,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for every single workload."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5115430,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in fact, when you look at our roadmap,\nwe have retained that very strong focus on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5120650,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "HPC and scientific computing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5122850,
    "dDurationMs": 7100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like MI455 leads in AI compute with\nFP4 and memory performance, MI430X leads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5129950,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "HPC compute with FP64 and memory\nperformance, two platforms purpose-built"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5135890,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for two very different classes of\nworkload."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5139170,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The MI430X is built by leveraging our\nmodular chiplet architecture to deliver a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5144830,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "purpose-built variant with native FP64\nhardware, giving customers leadership"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5150810,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance across AI and HPC in a single\nplatform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5155790,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is hardware double precision,\nnot emulation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5159890,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For the scientific community, that\ndistinction is everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5163710,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This product delivers 288 teraflops of\nFP64 compute, nearly nine times better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5169850,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than competition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5170630,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the same leadership, memory capacity,\nand bandwidth of MI455."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5176910,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The MI430X ships in the first half of\n2027."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5183030,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why leaders in sovereign AI love\nthis product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5188110,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first sovereign exascale AI factories\nin both US and Europe are being built on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5193410,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the MI430X."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5195030,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Discovery at Oak Ridge National Labs and\nAlice Recoque with Cines and Genci in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5200130,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Europe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5202070,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So look, as we look ahead, let me leave\nyou with this thought."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5206230,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every so often, our industry goes through\ninflection points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5210610,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've all felt it when neural networks\nfirst started recognizing cats and dogs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5215570,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when transformers changed what was\npossible with AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5218530,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I believe we are experiencing another one\nright now, a real inflection in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5223990,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ability of AI to program complex hardware\nsystems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5228070,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Building on the surface area that's been\nexposed from open source software and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5233030,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leveraging the power of abstracted\ninterfaces, AI is making it dramatically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5237850,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "easier to program AI systems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5240570,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We cannot wait what you will build with\nit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5244130,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5253620,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, AI is getting pervasively infused\ninto all forms of computing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5257840,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Enterprises are experiencing the same\nshift with their own unique requirements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5262520,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to tell us more about that\ntransformation, please welcome to stage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5266540,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Senior Vice President and General Manager\nof Compute and Enterprise AI, Dan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5272100,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "McNamara."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5280530,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Vamsi, and good morning,\neveryone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5284050,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a great pleasure for me to bring to\nyou the third pillar of our strategy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5288810,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is powering AI everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5291330,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the vision behind this has remained\nthe same for several years for us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5297290,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to deliver the right compute engine to the\nright workload, and then continuously"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5302450,
    "dDurationMs": 7300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drive optimization points across our\nentire portfolio, from CPUs, GPUs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5310470,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "networking, and FPGAs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5313130,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So building on what we've already shared,\nI'll cover how our strategy comes together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5318410,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across our enterprise portfolio and how\nthe foundation we built with the CPU"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5323310,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "franchise has truly positioned us for the\nnext era of AI across multiple deployment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5329790,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5331510,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Lisa talked about the frontier model\nand hyperscale landscape and just the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5336370,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rapid and massive advances we've seen over\nthe last 6 to 12 months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5341570,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those advances are driving the\nadoption of AI well beyond the cloud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5345590,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as AI continues to grow, it will\ndemand compute beyond the massive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5351030,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "purpose-built data centers that we all\nknow and love, extending into enterprise,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5355790,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "personal, and physical AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5357350,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And each of these brings a new or unique\nset of requirements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5362850,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Enterprises are usually constrained by\npower and cooling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5366150,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Personal AI usually must operate within a\nfairly limited compute and memory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5370990,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "footprint."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5371590,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And physical AI must perform reliably in\nreal-world demanding environments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5378590,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And AMD is the only company delivering a\ncomplete portfolio that spans all of these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5384110,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "development models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5386670,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I just mentioned that our journey began\nin the data center with our CPU franchise,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5392590,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I want to touch on it a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5393770,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With each generation of EPYC, our strategy\nhas been to listen to our customers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5398230,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "address their evolving needs, and deliver\nthe highest performance, lowest total cost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5403710,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of ownership, and the fastest time to\nvalue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5407650,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As Lisa mentioned earlier, we've\nintroduced many industry-firsts across our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5412270,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "generations that our enterprise customer\nhas actually asked for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5417190,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that customer focus has brought us to\nwhere we are today, with EPYC as the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5422830,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leader in enterprise computing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5424550,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And over the last three years,\nthere's been very, very strong adoption"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5428610,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across the enterprise, with the world's\nlargest companies moving more and more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5431950,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "workloads to AMD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5433790,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's reflected in a number of places."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5436230,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, public cloud, where our VM\nconsumption has grown at 76% CAGR over the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5441770,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "last three years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5443370,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on-prem deployments with our OEM and\nODM partners is growing quite aggressively"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5449730,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across key industries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5451950,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But just as important, this position\nallows us to understand truly the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5457610,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "diversity of the workloads that our\nenterprise customers run every day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5463110,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And each workload faces new demands on the\nCPU."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5468090,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some require maximum thread count,\nsome depend on per-core performance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5472810,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while others depend on memory bandwidth,\ncache efficiency, or I/O."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5476490,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5477810,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The really important point is that there\nis no single SKU that solves every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5483730,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enterprise application."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5485870,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's why our EPYC portfolio with\nVenice spans 8 to 256 cores, with a range"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5492050,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of power, frequencies, and I/O."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5493990,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "capabilities, giving customers the\nflexibility to choose the right solution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5498150,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for their workload, and most importantly,\nat the most optimized cost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5505070,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, Lisa mentioned this earlier,\nand now we all know, we covered Venice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5511070,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and she showed how we have strong\nleadership across AI host nodes and the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5516970,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "agentic workflows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5518650,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I wanted to show you how Venice\nactually leads across the general purpose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5523150,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "workloads of the enterprise and these\nworkloads that are running our customers'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5528370,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "line every day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5528970,
    "dDurationMs": 6940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you can see, we have a minimum of 2.5x\nthe performance across our competition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5536050,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across these very, very important\nenterprise workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5540230,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now, as we all know, agentic AI is\nreally the next major transition for the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5546830,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enterprise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5547550,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it truly is a force multiplier for\nenterprises, and adoption is accelerating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5553650,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, the latest data here shows that\nnearly every enterprise next year will"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5558170,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have some form of agentic deployments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5562530,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as enterprises move from pilots to\nproduction deployments, we've talked to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5568550,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "CIOs all the time, and they are looking at\nthree major things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5572710,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, predictable infrastructure cost and\ntoken cost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5577670,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Secondly, making sure the data is secure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5581050,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then lastly, and sometimes this is\noverlooked, right, integrating AI into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5586930,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their existing infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5588970,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not all greenfield out there for the\nenterprise customer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5593230,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to solve these problems, we truly\nbelieve that this is going to be a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5597430,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "distributed deployment model that\nleverages frontier models, cloud services,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5602270,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on-prem infrastructure, and of course,\nAI clients."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5605670,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as AI has moved from chatbots\nresponding to prompts to agents doing real"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5611570,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "work, writing code, summarizing documents,\nand running complex flows, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5617570,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "requirements have evolved also."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5620470,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those are exactly the requirements\nwe've been designing for for multiple"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5624610,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5625750,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So while AI will be deployed across all\nthese environments, the on-prem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5630850,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "deployments in our enterprise customers\nhave fairly unique constraints."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5635090,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First and foremost, power/cooling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5637730,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really big challenge in space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5639630,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of course, costs remain top of the\nlist for CIOs that are trying to drive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5646550,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things forward in the AI world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5649050,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then lastly, the full solutions they\nneed to be easy to deploy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5655970,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's been common for many, many years\nfor the enterprise, but that's something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5661530,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're very, very focused on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5662930,
    "dDurationMs": 7160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to address these constraints,\nthank you, Laura, I'm very happy to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5670090,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "announce the launch of the Instinct\nMI350P."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5679750,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So today, every enterprise wants AI in the\ndata center, but the challenge is how do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5685410,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you add those capabilities without\nstarting over?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5688610,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's exactly what the 350P was designed\nto solve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5691930,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's an air-cooled GPU designed to fit\nwithin the power and cooling of enterprise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5696830,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "servers today without a facilities\nupgrade."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5699810,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Making it easy to bring LLM scale\ninference into today's enterprise data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5705010,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5705630,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at the same time, there's no\ncompromise in capability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5709570,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A single MI350P can support up to 260\nbillion parameters, allowing customers to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5715370,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "run the majority of enterprise AI\nworkloads on a single GPU."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5720290,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the economics are actually even better\nand more compelling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5725010,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The 350P delivers more than four times the\ntokens per second per dollar than the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5730230,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "competition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5732130,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's pretty cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5736100,
    "dDurationMs": 6620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it actually turns the customer's\nexisting data center into an AI data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5742720,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5743980,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we all know that benchmarks are one\npart of the equation, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5749360,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other part is really evaluating,\ndoes the advantage hold up across the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5753700,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actual workload you run and how your\nbusiness runs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5756820,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we tested a set of workloads,\nenterprise use cases, using production"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5761660,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5762880,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the 350P delivers much higher\nproductivity than the competition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5767400,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "delivering up to two to five times faster\ntokens per second than the competition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5773720,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you think about that, that's more\ntokens per second, more work completed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5779760,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more users supported, all at a lower cost\nfor the business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5786460,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So another area that I wanted to talk\nabout is, our earliest customer is our own"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5791220,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AMD IT team."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5794160,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they're a tough group to work with,\neven for us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5798460,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they put us through our paces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5801700,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And really, this has been our model from\nday one is, we want to put our technology"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5806940,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into our own data center first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5808880,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So like many companies, many enterprises,\nwe're looking at how to deliver AI service"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5813060,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to our employee base, but also manage\ncosts and protect our data, manage and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5818460,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "control the data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5820020,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we focused on two use cases that we\nwanted to try out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5824720,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And first was autonomous threat detection."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5827440,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is probably one of the\nfaster-growing agentic applications that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5832080,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're seeing today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5832940,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the second was a personalized AI\nassistant running on OpenCloth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5837640,
    "dDurationMs": 6580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So both of these run route requests\nthrough the router, and the gateway sort"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5844220,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of tests the complexity, the sensitivity\nof the information, and the service level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5849200,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "requirements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5850960,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So some requests are sent to the Frontier\nmodel, while others are routed to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5855000,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OpenWeights models running on EPYC and an\nMI350P."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5859460,
    "dDurationMs": 6860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with intelligent routing, we reduced\nour token costs by 43%, while delivering"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5866320,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up to 3x faster response times for the\nworkloads running locally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5870940,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we believe this is how enterprise AI\nwill be deployed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5877840,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we also know that, from our history\nhere with EPYC, that enabling enterprise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5883740,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "takes a whole lot more than great silicon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5887240,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It requires a complete ecosystem of\nsoftware and solutions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5890900,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And over the last several years,\nwe've truly grown significantly and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5894480,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "expanded our enterprise AI ecosystem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5897020,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, we support numerous AI ISVs,\nprovide zero-day support for all of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5903040,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "industry's leading open models,\nand deliver robust frameworks that help"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5907160,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "customers bring AI into production as fast\nas possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5912200,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's all built on trusted platform\nsoftware and OEM partnerships that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5916620,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enterprises rely on every single day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5919920,
    "dDurationMs": 6780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, everything I just shared comes down\nto one goal for us, and that's helping"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5926700,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "customers deploy AI where it creates the\nmost value for them, whether it's in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5932620,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cloud, on-premise, or at the edge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5936360,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to bring this to life, I'd like to\nwelcome Jeremy Legg, Chief Technology"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5941340,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Officer at AT\u0026T."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5949560,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good to see you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5951020,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks, Jeremy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5951900,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks for having me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5953500,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, this is great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5954480,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's kind of a homecoming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5955540,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I grew up in the East Bay, so it's good to\nbe back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5958280,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, fantastic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5959040,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We really appreciate you joining us today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5960820,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So look, I think everyone knows AT\u0026T as\nthe largest communications company,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5967140,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of the largest in the world,\nand I'm sure half of them out there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5971840,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "probably have AT\u0026T network right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5974940,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hopefully more than half."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5978780,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But AI is touching way more than the\nnetwork, and you and your team are really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5983680,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doing a fair amount of work driving it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5986280,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can you share with us sort of the\nopportunities you approach, you're working"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5989600,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on, and your experience to date?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5992400,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, happy to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5993580,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At AT\u0026T, we're now burning about a\ntrillion-plus tokens per month,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5999440,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that number has gone up pretty\ndramatically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6002740,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's moving up double digits, and so this\nis now becoming very pervasive inside of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6008240,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the enterprise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6009500,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've got over 100 Gen A models in\nproduction across our enterprise as well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6015860,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those are stretching from things that\nI think a lot of folks are doing in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6020800,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "customer care, things that we're doing in\nfraud, but also things that you wouldn't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6025120,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "necessarily think about, like where's the\nbest place to place a cell tower or a RAN"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6030220,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is the most effective use of it\ninside of a network?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6034180,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So all of these things are happening\nacross our enterprise, but they're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6037560,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "happening at a scale that is not\nnecessarily normal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6041440,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We get over 300,000 calls a day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6044520,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The transcription of those calls is an\nenormous workload, and then driving the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6049060,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "insights out of those calls that we then\nbring back to the business is another set"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6052840,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of insights."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6054380,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's really an interesting thing,\nand now we're beginning to actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6058480,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rebuild entire workflows inside of the\ncompany beyond just the point use of a use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6064280,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6065120,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as we think about HR, as we think about\nfinance, and we think about different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6069380,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kinds of things that each of those\norganizations do, cash forecasting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6074280,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things that we do on onboarding employees\nas examples, we're now agentifying those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6078440,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "entire workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6080000,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, so we work closely with your team,\nand we've had many conversations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6086180,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's truly amazing the number of actual\nopportunities you're addressing with AI,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6093300,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so a super broad range of use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6095920,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can you just explain sort of what are\nthe key learnings in moving these to AI at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6102600,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enterprise scale, and then maybe a bit on\nwhat we've done together?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6105800,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6107120,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I'll start at a place that I don't\nthink everybody starts from here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6111700,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is the human."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6113860,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need world-class teams in order to do\nthis, and you need people that think in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6118520,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "workflows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6119540,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's an enormous amount of what I call\nracing from stoplight to stoplight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6124400,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Folks are going from 0 to 100,\nand then they hit the next stage of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6127800,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "workflow, and then there's a red light,\nand they haven't worked their way all the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6130920,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "way through that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6132160,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I would start with people and the\nquality of the people that you really have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6138200,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across your enterprise in order to do\nthese things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6140960,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second point is we are big believers\nin data sovereignty, and data sovereignty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6146640,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for us means not being tied to a specific\nchipset, not being tied to a specific"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6152160,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "model or a specific set of development\ntools."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6155380,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need, as an enterprise, to manage your\ndata."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6158020,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your data is your fuel in terms of how you\nimplement AI across that broader"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6162780,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enterprise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6163420,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we've done with AMD, and AMD's been\nsuch a great partner in this, is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6168700,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leveraging open source models,\nleveraging different sets of chipsets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6172860,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "building our own models, training other\nmodels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6176040,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're one of the few companies in the\nworld that's actually post-trained a model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6179160,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on AMD and then been able to drive\nequivalency in terms of performance and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6184280,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accuracy with other more expensive\nchipsets in the marketplace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6188440,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as we have done that, we've been able\nto drive down token costs, essentially"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6192820,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through money-balling across all of these\ndifferent models and leveraging that human"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6197340,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "capital in a way that's made a big\ndifference to our company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6201220,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so increasingly, even though token\nconsumption is going up, we're able to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6205640,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "manage that underlying token cost at\nenterprise scale, which is not a small"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6210320,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6211580,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, it's a bunch of great work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6213580,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another key area that's sort of\ngroundbreaking, which is exciting also,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6217520,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is you're the first telecom company to\nactually train a model on AMD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6221580,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And also, you're driving fully open source\nmodels in telecom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6225860,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So tell us about that experience and why\nyou felt like that was needed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6229720,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We felt like the industry was moving down\na path where folks were only going to use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6234900,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "closed source models to solve solutions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6237240,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while closed source models are an\nimportant ingredient in that, we didn't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6240860,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "want to lose sight of the fact that open\nsource models were going to be a very"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6243860,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "significant part of the solution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6245880,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we announced what we call OTEL 1.0."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6249160,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the open telco AI model a bit over\na year ago or so now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6253900,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we had over 18 million downloads of\nthat model since then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6259260,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're excited to announce today the launch\nof OTEL 2.0, which is a more advanced set"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6264300,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of models that we have trained on AMD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6267020,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we're now making that available via\nopen source across the broader industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6272120,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it, I think, is going to give folks an\nopportunity to see that not only do you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6276680,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "need to think about leveraging models,\nbut you also need to think about training"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6280100,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those models and how they work across your\nenterprise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6283820,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's just great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6284760,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We certainly appreciate the partnership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6286680,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, we really feel like this is\ngermane to the conversation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6290040,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's exactly what we've been talking about\ntoday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6292400,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I just want to thank you again for\njoining us and the partnership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6295700,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6296360,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're a big part of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6297880,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6302860,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so let me close with one last point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6306460,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've established ourselves as a leader in\nenterprise computing by listening to our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6311300,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "customers and delivering the right\nsolutions for their workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6315620,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, we're extending that leadership to\nhelp customers accelerate their AI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6321180,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "journey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6322580,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is our vision for powering AI\neverywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6326660,
    "dDurationMs": 7100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to expand a little bit beyond the data\ncenter into physical and client AI,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6334380,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's my pleasure to introduce Mr. Jack\nHuynh, who leads our computing and graphics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6339520,
    "dDurationMs": 320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "group."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6339840,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6345820,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Dan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6348080,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's great to see so many friends,\npartners, and developers here in San"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6351920,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Francisco."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6353180,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, we have seen how AMD is building\nthe compute foundation for AI in a data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6358860,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6359680,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the full AI transformation requires\ntwo more ingredients."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6363780,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Intelligence that becomes personal,\nand intelligence that can understand and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6367500,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "act in a physical world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6369440,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those are the two frontiers I want to\nexplore with you here today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6372600,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's begin with personal AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6375700,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Enterprise AI is already reshaping the\ndata center, but agentic AI will extend"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6380660,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "far beyond it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6382240,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Agents are the next great productivity\nmultiplier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6386020,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The jump from software that responds to\nsoftware that completes work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6390840,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A personal agent can double what one\nperson can do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6394320,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A team of agents can multiply that by 10."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6397040,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as agents gain more capabilities,\nthe opportunity can grow exponentially."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6401420,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that promise has a compute\nconsequence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6404800,
    "dDurationMs": 6220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unlike a single AI query, as agent\nreasons, calls tools, and coordinates to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6411020,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other agents, and run nonstop,\nagents become more capable and pervasive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6417880,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So will token consumption, meaning that\ndemand will require every layer of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6422980,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "computing ecosystem to scale together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6425920,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Data centers remain the foundation for\nfrontier AI in the most demanding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6429700,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6430700,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But edge-inclined systems can extend that\ncapacity, putting more intelligence closer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6436860,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to where data is created and where the\nwork gets done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6441200,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The PC is already one of the most powerful\ncompute engines ever placed in the hands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6446300,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of an individual."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6447600,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Across billions of devices, enormous\ncomputing capability is already deployed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6452200,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every single day, yet its potential\nremains largely untapped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6457320,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Putting that capacity to work changed the\neconomics of computing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6461340,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More workloads can run on systems that are\nalready in place, reducing overall"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6466200,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "infrastructure costs and allowing data\ncenters to focus on the largest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6470200,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most demanding task."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6472020,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And local computing brings inherent\nadvantages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6475180,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your data stays with you, your\napplications remain responsive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6479100,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and your system keeps working,\neven when your network does not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6484460,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And thanks to a new generation of smaller,\nmore capable AI models, we're beginning to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6490340,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unlock that potential."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6492840,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the unlock is happening faster than\nanyone expected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6497280,
    "dDurationMs": 8040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Last August, GPT OSS needed 120 billion\nparameters to score 80 on GPQA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6505900,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just seven months later, Qwen 3.5 scored\neven higher, with only 9 billion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6512860,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Better performance, with 13 times fewer\nparameters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6516380,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is not an incremental improvement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6519940,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a dramatic shift in the compute\nrequired to deliver advanced intelligence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6525500,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is a trend, not an outlier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6529060,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Smaller, open models are closing the\nfrontier gap at extraordinary speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6534820,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Qwen 3.6, 27 billion parameters now\noutperforms leading frontier models from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6541420,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the previous generation on graduate-level\nreasoning, at a fraction of the size and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6547160,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6548100,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That changes what is possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6551720,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Workloads once reserved for the cloud can\nnow run on powerful compute engines designed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6557760,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for personal AI compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6560640,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's map these model performance\nbreakthroughs to any platforms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6566120,
    "dDurationMs": 7740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ryzen AI 400 supports models up to 24\nbillion parameters, more than enough for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6573860,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Qwen 3.5, 9 billion, with substantial\nheadroom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6578920,
    "dDurationMs": 6260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ryzen AI Max extends that capacity to\nmodels as large as 200 billion parameters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6585740,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "running natively on a personal system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6588560,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This has not reduced AI, compressed to fit\non a PC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6592600,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a new class of personal computing\nbuilt to run powerful models where the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6597740,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "work actually happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6599940,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is exactly what led us to build\nRyzen AI Halo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6605200,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We wanted to give developers a platform\npowerful enough to run these models"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6609140,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "locally, yet simple enough to use every\nday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6613400,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With 120 gigabytes of unified memory and\nsupport for models up to 200 billion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6619180,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "parameters, developers can build,\ntest, and iterate locally directly on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6626620,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their desk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6628180,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ryzen AI Halo embodies the future of\npersonal AI for everyone, a future that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6633480,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shortens the distance between an idea and\na working model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6638220,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For developers, that means a dramatically\nmore efficient and optimized path from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6643160,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experimentation to deployment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6646460,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as Vamsi showed earlier, rocm.ai is\nmaking hardware programming radically more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6652420,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accessible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6654220,
    "dDurationMs": 6500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Developers can understand, modify,\nand optimize code for ROCm, even without"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6660720,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "deep ROCm expertise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6663360,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And better yet, the same open software\nfoundation extends across all of AMD's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6669100,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6670200,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Developers can use the frameworks and\ntools they already know, start locally on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6674800,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ryzen AI Halo, and scale across the full\nAMD compute platform without rebuilding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6680440,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6682060,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we're not stopping there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6683740,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, we're expanding our partnership\nwith Hugging Face to bring the open AI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6688980,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ecosystem directly on Ryzen AI Halo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6693320,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Powerful compute only creates value when\ndevelopers can quickly access the right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6699160,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "models, optimize them for the platform,\nand turn them into real applications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6705000,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Together, AMD and Hugging Face will\ndeliver Halo optimized performance for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6711060,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "open models and agentic workflows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6716180,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How cool is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6719400,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And along with co-engineered libraries and\ntoolkits designed to help developers spend"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6724160,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "less time configuring infrastructure and\nmore time building."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6728860,
    "dDurationMs": 6420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And later this year, every Ryzen AI Halo\nbox will include a full year of Hugging"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6735280,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Face Pro, putting the power of partnership\nin developers' hands from day one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6741520,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Freedom and more power to the user."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6745140,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is how we accelerate innovation in\nthe AI era."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6750300,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we're already pushing that vision\nfurther with Gorgon Halo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6755760,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And seeing is believing, look at how\nsmall and beautiful this box is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6766080,
    "dDurationMs": 6940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've increased unified memory from 128 to\n192 gigabytes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6773540,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The largest unified memory pool in this\nclass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6776920,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And increased model support from 200\nbillion to 300 billion parameters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6783200,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Laura."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6786870,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is no longer limited to a single\nplatform form factor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6791050,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Together, with the world's leading OEMs,\nAMD now powers the broadest portfolio of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6796650,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "personal AI systems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6798270,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From laptops and workstations to mini PCs\nand developer platforms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6803170,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means developers, enterprises,\nand creators can choose the right system"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6808350,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the way they want to build and work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6811610,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Personal AI is not a concept."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6813690,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a category and is available right\nnow on AMD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6818830,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We now have all the pieces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6821650,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Models are efficient enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6823770,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hardware is powerful enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6825970,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Software stack is open and ready."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6828310,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And open harnesses like Lemonade Server\ncan route workloads to the right model and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6832650,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6834050,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The technology is here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6835930,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next challenge is taking it from one\ndeveloper's desk to thousands of users"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6840350,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across an enterprise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6842110,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cisco sees and believes in that future the\nsame way we do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6845630,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To take us deeper into how we turn that\nvision into enterprise scale reality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6850330,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "please join me in welcoming to the stage\nJeetu Patel, President and Chief Product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6854970,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Officer at Cisco."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6859450,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeetu, how are you doing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6860870,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How are you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6861350,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You look great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6861930,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you for joining me here today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6864270,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Congratulations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6865230,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6866470,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now Jeetu, you and I talk how we're at an\ninflection point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6869350,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for the past few years, industry has\nspent time just building intelligence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6874790,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next phase is how we deploy this\ntechnology at scale enterprises."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6878750,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You spent so much of your time talking to\nCIOs, technology leaders."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6882850,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are they telling you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6883610,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's changing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6884770,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, firstly, it's a really exciting time\nto be alive in tech."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6887730,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you just take a step back right now\nand see what's happening, there's actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6891530,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a fundamental shift that's happening in\nthe patterns of inferencing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6895150,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you think about the patterns of\ninferencing that existed during the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6898230,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chatbot era that was human-led,\nit was very, very spiky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6901610,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You ask a question, you get an answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6903290,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What you're starting to see with agents is\nthey're working 7x24."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6907890,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're very consumptive on bandwidth and\non infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6910730,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you're starting to see a much more\npersistent pattern of kind of demand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6914790,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "signal for infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6916210,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, we usually joke around\ninternally, humans click, but agents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6920370,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "swarm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6922190,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so as you start to see this,\nwhat you're going to have is a tremendous"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6926410,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "amount of and there's two big concerns\nthat are also there, which is one is every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6931670,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "customer is concerned about security and\nevery customer is concerned about cost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6936990,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what you're starting to see happen is\ninferencing is not just going to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6941690,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "limited to the data center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6943130,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inferencing is going to be distributed\neverywhere and there's a whole new class"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6946450,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of computing that's emerging with this\ndesk-side computing that you just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6950610,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "announced where there's going to be\ninferencing that you're going to have a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6953890,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "laptop or a desktop where humans work,\nand they might have a desk-side computer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6958550,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where agents are kind of going out and\nrunning their jobs on behalf of humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6962950,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's what we're seeing, essentially."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6965290,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're fully aligned Jeetu and that's exactly\nthe shift we're seeing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6969010,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If AI is moving closer to employees,\ncompute has to move closer as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6972870,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The PC's knowledge as a productivity\ndevice becomes an intelligence node in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6978390,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enterprise but deploying intelligence\neverywhere creates a new trend for CIOs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6982890,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you and I talk about so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6984890,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do you operate thousands of these\nsystems with the security, governance and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6989350,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "control enterprises require?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6991770,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeetu, how is AMD and Cisco solving this and\nwhat are we building together?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6996830,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, so this is an exciting time because\nwhat you're starting to see is there's a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7001410,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "few things that need to really be done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7003210,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't just go out and deploy your\ndesk-side computers and hope that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7008310,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything works out in the enterprise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7009730,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need to make sure that it's governed,\nit's managed and so there's a few things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7013550,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are really important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7014530,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number one, you have to have an\nappropriate amount of network bandwidth to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7018270,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "satiate the needs of the agents that you\nare going to run locally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7022010,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this notion of network infrastructure\nthat can get modernized to keep up with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7026830,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the needs that you're going to go out and\ngenerate is going to be very important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7030050,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's number one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7030810,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number two, like I said, every customer is\nreally worried about token costs and so we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7035810,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "need to make sure that we can actually\ncontain the costs of an agent's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7039250,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "consumption of tokens when it actually\nstarts to go awry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7042030,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Up and down when needed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7043150,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7044330,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number three then is how do we monitor\nagent behavior for safety and security so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7050150,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that if it does start to do things that we\ndon't want it to do, we can in runtime"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7053830,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "provide enforcement guardrails."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7056010,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then fourthly, it's just the overall\nsafety and security that you need to have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7060590,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from an apparatus perspective to get this\nentire thing humming in the way that you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7064170,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "want it to hum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7064970,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, it's great how you and I think very\nalike."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7067370,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I mean the opportunity is not just\nbringing every device as you and I talk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7071370,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do we enable enterprise to deploy,\nmanage the skill with confidence?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7075510,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why don't we take a look at what we've\nbeen building the past few weeks and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7078610,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "months.\nYeah, it's exciting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7080190,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So basically what we've done is there's a\nfull stack that you can start to think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7084250,
    "dDurationMs": 400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7084650,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what you folks have done with Halo is\nyou've got an isolated secure agent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7090290,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sandbox."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7091270,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've got intelligent routing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7092970,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've got an MCP kind of core set of\nintegrations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7098910,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then what we've done above that is\nwe've made sure that you have the right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7102870,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "level of security policy enforcement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7104930,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've also got the right level of\nobservability so that it's an end-to-end"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7109770,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "resilient infrastructure stack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7111490,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's observability of how is your\napparatus and the infrastructure working."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7117310,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is the agent behavior being done in the\nright way?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7120350,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you observe the agent behavior?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7121890,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And are the tokenomics within the\nguidelines that you want them to be?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7126930,
    "dDurationMs": 6460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then what we have is a single unified\nmanagement plane, a control plane that can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7133390,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look at every single dimension that you\nhave and be managed within one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7138410,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "environment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7139410,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so that's kind of the full stack,\nand we are really, really excited about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7142930,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the partnership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7143790,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Us too, our teams love working with your team Jeetu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7146310,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How is this all managed?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7147390,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How does the CAO deploy this at scale?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7149710,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, so let's take a look at what this\nlooks like, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7151790,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because what we would have is this is\nCisco Cloud Control, which is the overall"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7157050,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "management plane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7157850,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you happen to have Halo devices on\nevery desktop, which it might actually get"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7164330,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to, what you want to make sure that you do\nis you are able to go out and manage your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7169950,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "entire estate of not just your Halo fleet,\nbut also what you have running on the data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7175550,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "centers, as well as what you have running\nin the cloud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7178090,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can provide full visibility for\nthat entirety of the estate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7183230,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then once you've got that,\nwhat we also have is this notion of how do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7187450,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we go out and monitor tokenomics?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7190290,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so is the agent behaving the way that\nit needs to behave, or is the agent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7195550,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually going out and being overly\nconsumptive?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7198690,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At which point, you should be able to\nisolate any individual Halo device so that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7203610,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can make sure that you can quarantine\nit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7205290,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, I love this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7205830,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then we can actually see the return on\ninvested capital."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7207670,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It could pay for itself in three or six\nmonths even quicker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7210670,
    "dDurationMs": 300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7210970,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what you see over here basically is you\ncan tell how every single agent is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7215910,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performing and whether or not they're\nconsuming way too much kind of token"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7220430,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "costs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7220910,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if they are, how do you actually\ncontain the costs as you're going through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7223630,
    "dDurationMs": 360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7223990,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, I love this Jeetu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7225210,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, everyone else is wondering when can\nthey buy this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7228870,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When is this open for everyone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7230850,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the good news is you can buy the\nHalo already today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7234830,
    "dDurationMs": 360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7235190,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then what we're doing is we're making\nsure that we provide this entire"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7238390,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "management apparatus that's currently in\nearly availability for a select set of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7244070,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "customers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7244870,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we'll have it in general availability\nin the US in early fall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7250130,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're excited to make sure that we can\nprovide not just the compute, but all of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7254390,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the apparatus that's needed to go out and\nmanage this so that you can have inference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7257890,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "running in the cloud, you can have\ninference running in your data center"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7261270,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "privately, or you can have inference\nrunning on your desk side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7265070,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeetu, we're so grateful to be part of you\nand Cisco."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7267490,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're so excited."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7268590,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7269450,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Congratulations.\nTake care, Jeetu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7270470,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7275450,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What you just saw brings a vision of\nscaling AI seamlessly and securely for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7279850,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "personal devices all the way to the cloud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7282750,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in the age of AI, intelligence will be\npervasive and it will be everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7287830,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next frontier is where AI leaves the\nscreen, enters the world and acts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7293830,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That frontier is physical AI, the ultimate\napplication of agentic frameworks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7299630,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the digital world, an agent plans and\ncompletes a task."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7303790,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the physical world, it must also sense\nmotion, navigate uncertainty, and protect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7310350,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7311370,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here, intelligence does not just produce\nan answer, it produces an action."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7316690,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When answers become actions, latency\nbecomes safety and reliability becomes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7321550,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7323010,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is why the promise of physical AI is\nso incredibly powerful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7326970,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is not about replacing human potential."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7329530,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is about amplifying it, giving surgeons\ngreater precision, keeping people out of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7336090,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "harm's way, making farms more productive,\nsupply chains more resilient, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7341870,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "factories more efficient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7344010,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The best technology does not make people\nsmaller."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7346970,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It gives them much greater reach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7349490,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For more than 20 years, AMD has helped\npower the core capabilities that robotics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7354590,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depend on, from sensing and functional\nsafety to deterministic control and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7359990,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "precision motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7361830,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That foundation is already trusted by\nmillions of companies to find the future"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7365590,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of robotics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7366230,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now, that foundation is coming alive\nin extraordinary ways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7372670,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are not machines following a script."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7375270,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are beginning to perceive the world,\nreason through uncertainty, and act with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7380430,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "purpose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7381610,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The promise of physical AI, already in\nmotion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7386390,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next era of robotics is not\nprogrammed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7389650,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is autonomous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7391130,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While traditional robots execute\ninstructions, autonomous robots are given"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7395630,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an objective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7397250,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And from there, they determine how to\nachieve it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7399870,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they do this all at once, and all in\nreal time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7403910,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The robot must orchestrate intelligence,\nmotion, and safety continuously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7410110,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And every part must respond at the speed\nof the world around it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7415290,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That demands an entirely new kind of\nrobotics brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7419530,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to solve that, we rethought its\narchitecture from the ground up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7424050,
    "dDurationMs": 7340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, I'm so excited to introduce the AMD\nKria AI System On Module, powered by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7431390,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ryzen AI Embedded X100."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7438790,
    "dDurationMs": 7700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It brings CPU, GPU, NPU, and unified\nmemory together in one compact,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7446770,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "open standard architecture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7448890,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This allows robots to process perception,\nAI reasoning, and do it all simultaneously"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7455850,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in real time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7458310,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The architecture is different,\nbut the results are decisive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7462710,
    "dDurationMs": 6260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In third party testing against NVIDIA\nJetson Thor, Kria delivers 3.4 times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7468970,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "better real-time results, 2.3 times more\nconcurrent agents, and 1.6 times more CPU"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7476490,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "capacity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7477310,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means faster reactions, and greater\nheadroom for the robot to take on more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7483070,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "complex work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7484650,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And all this without compromising control\nor safety."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7488830,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But to find the next era of robotics takes\nmore than a powerful brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7495390,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Developers need a complete path from an\nidea to a machine operating in the real"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7500710,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7502010,
    "dDurationMs": 6380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, we are introducing AMD's Kria AI\nRobotics Developer Platform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7513990,
    "dDurationMs": 6620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The industry's first turnkey open,\nfully integrated robotic system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7522150,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Laura, so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7527880,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the center is the Kria AI System on\nmodule, paired with a robotics carrier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7533940,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "card designed for sensing and\nconnectivity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7537840,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Built on ROCm and ROS2, this platform\ngives developers everything they need to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7542600,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "move from concept to prototype in days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7546220,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the same module carries forward into\nproduction, with no migration or redesign"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7551700,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "needed at the finish line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7553420,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can build faster and move from\nimagination to deployment with absolute"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7558300,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "confidence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7559940,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the breadth only AMD can bring to\nautonomous robotics from the first signal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7565300,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the final motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7567720,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AMD Kria for the brain, Versal for the\nspine, Zynq for the joints, and Spartan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7574680,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the sensors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7576180,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each layer purpose built for its role,\nworking together in one intelligent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7581400,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "system, connecting perception and\nhigh-level reasoning to real-time control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7588700,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The future will not be defined by one\nmodel, one machine, or one company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7594660,
    "dDurationMs": 6500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will be built in the open, across\nsilicon, software, systems, and an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7601160,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ecosystem moving forward together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7603940,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From the cloud to the PC and now into the\nphysical world, AMD continues to build a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7609540,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "compute foundation for intelligence\neverywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7613300,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll laser focused on the future so our\nsolution can augment and expand what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7617880,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people are capable of achieving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7619820,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next era of AI will not just unfold\nbehind the screen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7623520,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will unfold in the world around us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7626020,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now, to bring it all together and take\nus to what comes next, please welcome back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7631120,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lisa to the stage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7637860,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hi, Lisa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7640460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7641620,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you, Jack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7642780,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's been a big day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7644660,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've covered a lot, from our data center\nproducts, to enterprise AI, to personal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7649780,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and physical AI, and the software that\nties it all together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7653220,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the strongest product portfolio in\nour history."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7656500,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we believe it's the strongest\nportfolio in the industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7659700,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's really just the beginning,\nbecause what our customers count on is not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7664700,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7665760,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They really count on us looking ahead and\npushing the bleeding edge of technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7670440,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I want to spend the last few minutes\ngiving you a preview of what we're working"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7673980,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7674960,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Starting with CPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7676900,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2028, we're going to introduce\nFlorence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7680560,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Florence brings the next Gen Zen 7 cores."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7684000,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's leading-edge process technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7685860,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a new set of AI compute extensions to\nreally ensure that we have all of the AI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7691400,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "capability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7692180,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it supports the latest memory\ntechnologies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7694860,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we're not stopping there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7696300,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're already deep in development of\nRavenna, our eighth-generation EPYC family"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7701300,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "built on Zen 8."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7702620,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that family is already well under\ndevelopment for 2030."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7707400,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, to give you a little bit of a flavor,\nFlorence is again going to extend our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7712320,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "biggest advantage with EPYC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7713760,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's all about product breath and having\nthe right foundation and also the right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7719900,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "family for each workload."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7721520,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you have Florence, you have Ferrara,\nyou have Fidenza."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7725220,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's really built on a full family of\nCPUs that is optimized for these different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7730400,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "workloads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7731220,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's giving the customers the right CPU\nfor every workload."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7735560,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is our commitment with EPYC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7738540,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, moving to Instinct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7740500,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are continuing our cadence of\ndelivering a new generation every single"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7745560,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7746800,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MI500 brings next-generation HBM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7750020,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It brings a larger scale-up domain because\nscaling is everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7754520,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it introduces new copper and optical\ninterconnects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7758560,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with MI600, it's powered by our CDNA\nNext architecture, and it's already deep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7763560,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in development for 2028."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7766300,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, to give you an idea of what we see\nfrom a performance standpoint,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7770320,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every generation of Instinct has delivered\na major big step up in performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7776560,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with MI455, we've talked a lot about\nit, delivering 35 times more inference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7781200,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "throughput compared to MI355."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7784540,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we're really, really excited about\nMI500."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7787720,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we see is another opportunity to take\na major step up and actually bend the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7793260,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "curve again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7794580,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So MI500 will deliver the largest\ngenerational leap in the industry of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7798660,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instinct, putting us on track to deliver\nmore than 2,000 times higher inference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7803480,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "throughput in just four years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7812900,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, what I can tell you is we are working\nwith a number of our customers already on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7817000,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this design point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7818140,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MI500 is super exciting, and the feedback\nwe're getting from customers is just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7823740,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fantastic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7824760,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, put the CPU, GPU, and the networking\nroadmaps together, and you can now see a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7830580,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "complete cadence of our rack scale\nsystems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7833300,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you should expect from AMD a new Helios\nsystem every year delivering more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7839120,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance, more capacity so that we can\nrun larger models, more agents at better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7844860,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "total cost of ownership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7846440,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that gives our customers the complete,\npredictable roadmap to plan and scale"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7851660,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their infrastructure for years to come."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7854400,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So lots of exciting things in store over\nthe next few years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7858600,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with that, let me wrap this up for this\nmorning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7862060,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, I hope you saw a little bit about\nhow we're really looking at that compute"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7867760,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from every angle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7869140,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So every aspect of AI compute,\nwhether you're talking about Helios or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7873500,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MI455 or Venice for the world's largest AI\nsystems, or you're talking about MI430 and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7879980,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MI350 for Sovereign and Enterprise AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7883300,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You saw the passion in Vamsi with ROCm\nAI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7886300,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's so good to see how much has come\nthrough that platform in terms of making"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7890680,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "developers make it much, much easier for\ndevelopers to access the AMD platform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7896700,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then Jack talked about Gorgon Halo and\nour new Kria AI platforms really bringing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7901700,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "together the leadership of the end-to-end\nAI story, including PCs and physical AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7907360,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So lots of new information, but I want to\nsay a very, very special thank you to all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7912720,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of our partners who joined us today\nbecause it is really through those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7916200,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "partnerships that we're able to do the\nmost amazing things together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7921400,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if I just leave you with a final\nthought, when I think about where AI is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7926140,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "today, the biggest change that we see is\nwe're no longer talking about what might"
