      "utf8": "industry and every part of our lives,\nour personal lives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7942560,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I have to say that I've spent my\nentire career in tech believing that"
