      "utf8": "high-performance computing can make the\nworld an incredibly better place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7952400,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I have never, ever believed that more\nthan I do today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7956400,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At AMD, what we're focused on is building\nthe technology, the roadmaps, and the"
    } ]
  }, {
